pill stays absolutely positioned because it is a floating overlay.\n  - The 40px count spacer in the Serendipity row stays, since removing it changes the text box width.\n  - Space pills are 28px tall while tag pills are 26px. That inconsistency is visual, so I left it for a designer decision.\n  - Colours with no exact token stay as they are: the root `#0A0A09`, library frame `#0D0C0B`, zoom pill `#1B1917EB` (alpha), avatar `#2A2521`, and the greys and beiges used for text.\n  - The viewer's `background` shorthand and the image URLs are untouched.\n\n**2.2 Item · Resurf-style · Similar tab (5PB-0)**\n- **Tokens:** the same sidebar, toolbar and icon changes as above. The quote and note tiles now use `--library-surface` and `--library-border`, and the note tile's text uses the muted and text tokens.\n- **Structure:** the same logo-wrapper removal.\n- **Names:** the same pattern, plus \"Column · left/right\", \"Image tile · &lt;name&gt;\", \"Quote tile · Kyoto notes\" and \"Note tile · Izakayas\".\n- **Left alone:** the image tile radius is exactly 12px, which equals `--toggle-radius`. I did not switch it, because a tile would then be tied to a token named for toggles. This needs a decision from you if you want it switched anyway.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>196481</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>37</tool_uses><duration_ms>304112</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
