{"parentUuid":"13a2100f-b4d3-4920-a952-58d26e549356","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAkmP4R2Naoi44vt2oLq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The agent for 2.3 and 2.4 has also finished. I'll check its work against the backups along with the others once all four are done.\n\nIt made the same kinds of changes as the 2.1–2.2 agent: it removed the logo wrapper, switched exact-match colours to tokens, and gave layers proper names. On 2.4, the quote and note cards had been named \"Dark glowing circles\", after their background texture. They're now \"Quote card\" and \"Note card\".\n\nIt reports pixel-identical results:\n- **2.4:** byte-identical to its backup.\n- **2.3:** matches its backup on a fresh capture. One earlier capture differed inside the first Nearby image tile. The agent saw the same variance when it re-captured the untouched backup, so it puts this down to the image loading, not its edits.\n\n**Leftover found:** the dotted background behind the item viewer contains a stray, unresolved token reference (`t:4-0`). I'll check what it is when I verify the screens. If it isn't needed, removing it is an easy cleanup.\n\nTwo agents are still running: 1.1–1.3 and 3.1–4.1."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1896,"cache_read_input_tokens":51634,"output_tokens":363,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1896,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":363,"cache_read_input_tokens":51634,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1896,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1896},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],