{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-19T01:51:35.538Z","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>af88cc1a01860cf27</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_018MhMSjoe3mNrvg5oxH3gtP</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tasks\\af88cc1a01860cf27.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Audit Paper screens 3.1–4.1\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>All three owned artboards are cleaned up, and their final scale-1 screenshots match the backups by eye, region by region. That is a visual comparison, not a pixel diff. `finish_working_on_nodes` has been called for `4XI-0`, `551-0` and `4RN-0`. No repo files changed.\n\n**Backups (unedited, for you to verify and delete)**\n- `7PD-0` \"BACKUP · 3.1 Settings · Library\" at (0, 9300)\n- `7X5-0` \"BACKUP · 3.2 Settings · Archive\" at (1520, 9300)\n- `85A-0` \"BACKUP · 4.1 Mascot · search bar travel + states\" at (3040, 9300)\n\n**4XI-0 · 3.1 Settings · Library**\n- Changed:\n  - Exact-match hex colours and radii swapped for the library tokens, including text, muted, accent and surface.\n  - Removed dead `width: max-content` on 52M-0, 52T-0 and 52Z-0 (now `auto`, no visible change).\n  - Removed the logo and title wrappers (523-0 and 4YX-0), moving their children up.\n  - Renamed about 110 layers; no generic names remain.\n- Left alone:\n  - SVG fill and stroke attributes stay as hex. A `var()` in an SVG presentation attribute does not resolve in browsers, so I tried it on 51F-0, saw the breakage, and reverted.\n  - Off-token colours (e.g. `#0A0A09`, `#C9C1B6`, alpha overlays) and off-token radii (19px, 10px, 16px, 8px, 3px, 2px, pills).\n  - Absolute overlays: Scrim 528-0, Settings sheet 52A-0, Bottom fade 4XK-0 with its odd offsets.\n  - Padding-only wrappers and fixed-width icon and count slots that hold column alignment.\n  - `rotate: 0deg` no-op on 4SL-0 and `marginTop: auto` on the sidebar footer.\n- Final screenshot: matches `7PD-0`.\n\n**551-0 · 3.2 Settings · Archive**\n- Changed:\n  - Same token swaps as 4XI, plus card and overlay radii and border sides.\n  - Removed `width: max-content` on 57E-0, 578-0 and 572-0.\n  - Removed the logo and title wrappers (5C6-0 and 590-0).\n  - Renamed all layers, including the two lease rectangles (5DA-0 \"Lease line\", 5DB-0 \"Lease line short\").\n- Left alone: the same categories as 4XI.\n- Final screenshot: matches `7X5-0`, including the card grid, the selected Restore state and the video duration pill.\n\n**4RN-0 · 4.1 Mascot · search bar travel + states**\n- Changed:\n  - Root and mini-sidebar backgrounds and radii, plus search pill radii and border colours.\n  - Text, muted and accent colours on exact matches.\n  - Renamed all layers (travel frames t0–t3, mini parts, expressions, captions, return row).\n- Left alone:\n  - Opacity-0 nodes 4T0-0 and 4TF-0, kept as animation states per the brief.\n  - SVG attributes, off-token values and the `rotate: 0deg` no-op, as in 4XI.\n- Final screenshot: matches `85A-0`.\n\n**Flags for you**\n- Exact-match swaps couple unrelated elements. The 20px radius now references `--search-radius` on the quote, note and PDF cards in 4XI and 551. The 9px radius references `--button-radius-normal` on nav, space and rail rows, which are not buttons. Visually identical, but the names are misleading. Revert those specific nodes if you want role-based tokens.\n- Scratch analysis files are in `C:/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/paper-scripts/` and `paper-jsx-*.txt`, outside the worktree.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>51846</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>66</tool_uses><duration_ms>553869</duration_ms