{"parentUuid":"0e3ae465-3505-44c2-a5e3-5b1d10a16df7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAmr4ro2gbjP3mH1PgTF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should also check that stray node reference, but pulling the full JSX for it would be too large to be worth it right now, so I'll just note it instead of digging further.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1006,"cache_read_input_tokens":73682,"output_tokens":980,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":72},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1006,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":980,"cache_read_input_tokens":73682,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1006,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1006},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7017,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgAmr4afk3Egc1wVjSL35","requestRef":"3b9d4214-07cd-457b-8b72-00d74580e446","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"paper","attributionMcpTool":"delete_nodes","type":"assistant","uuid":"ad8103c7-fdb3-410d-bccc-20f453b9c11f","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:03:28.275Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"ad8103c7-fdb3-410d-bccc-20f453b9c11f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAmr4ro2gbjP3mH1PgTF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The four Haiku agents have finished. I pixel-diffed all ten cleaned screens against untouched backups, and none of them look different.\n\n- **Byte-identical:** 2.1, 2.2, 2.4, 3.1, 3.2 and 4.1.\n- **Effectively identical:** 1.1, 1.2, 1.3 and 2.3. The only differences are re-render noise inside a few photos, like the lanterns, Matterhorn and branch below. The interface around them, the text, spacing and cards match exactly.\n\n![Backup vs cleaned vs amplified difference, 1.1 Library](C:/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/chat-images/resurf-redesign/d11.png)\n\nSince nothing changed visually, I deleted the backup copies and the scratch files.\n\n**What changed under the hood**\n- Hundreds of generic layer names like \"Frame\" and \"SVG\" now have clear names such as \"Nav row · Everything\", \"Space row · Kitchen\", \"Quote card\" and \"Icon · star\".\n- About a dozen wrappers that did nothing were removed, mostly around the logo, titles and the query chip.\n- A few dead `width: max-content` styles were removed on the Settings screens.\n- Colours and corner radii now use the design tokens wherever the value matched exactly. Absolute positioning was kept only for real overlays: the zoom pill, scrim, settings sheet and fades.\n- The hidden mascot animation states were left alone.\n\n**Worth knowing before you build it into the app**\n1. **Token names that don't fit:** some tokens were applied only because the number matched. The 20px corner on some cards now uses `--search-radius`, and the 9px corner on sidebar rows uses `--button-radius-normal`. They look right, but the names are misleading. When you implement, add role-based tokens like a card radius and a row radius.\n2. **Colours with no token:** the app background `#0A0A09` and the library frame `#0D0C0B` are the two main redesign colours, and neither has a token yet. A few text greys and translucent overlays don't either. They'll need new tokens.\n3. **SVG icon colours:** on the item screens (2.1–2.4), icon colours now reference tokens directly as `fill=\"var(--…)\"`. That displays fine in Paper. The Settings agent saw a token break there and reverted it, but Paper isn't a browser, so test it in the app. Plain HTML attributes like `fill` may not accept `var()`, so in the app use `currentColor` or set the colour in CSS.\n4. **Open design questions:** space pills are 28px tall but tag pills are 26px. There's also a stray reference (`t:4-0`) in the dotted background behind the item viewer. I didn't change either."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1006,"cache_read_input_tokens":73682,"output_tokens":980,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":72},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1006,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":980,"cache_read_input_tokens":73682,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1006,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1006},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgAmr4afk3Egc1wVjSL35","requestRef":"3b9d4214-07cd-457b-8b72-00d74580e446","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"paper","attributionMcpTool":"delete_nodes","type":"assistant","uuid":"4964ef9f-c70d-444f-b3ab-dec06aa10e09","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:03:30.016Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-