{"parentUuid":"2451e873-9fdc-4c8b-ae41-da4db1e993a9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAnGKSo8PBXRkZaYd4pr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should keep my answer brief and to the point.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":214,"cache_read_input_tokens":145411,"output_tokens":846,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":214,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":846,"cache_read_input_tokens":145411,"cache_creation_input_tokens":214,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":214},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6870,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgAnGK1kSymVzDhXfz71d","requestRef":"b43ac6f6-ec85-42d7-b8d5-777de49a1d17","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"paper","attributionMcpTool":"finish_working_on_nodes","type":"assistant","uuid":"40d27aeb-2032-49e9-89e1-c3b774a53d03","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:08:57.168Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"40d27aeb-2032-49e9-89e1-c3b774a53d03","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAnGKSo8PBXRkZaYd4pr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added eight new tokens in Paper and moved every element onto the token for its role, so nothing shares a token just because the numbers match.\n\nI left the existing tokens alone because the app's `App.css` uses the same names, and renaming them would cause a mismatch when you implement. Each new role token has its own value instead of pointing at an old token. If you later change cards to 22px, the search bar stays at 20px.\n\n**New colour tokens**\n\n| Token | Value | Used on |\n|---|---|---|\n| `--app-background` | `#0A0A09` | The darker background behind the sidebar, and the settings sheet |\n| `--library-frame` | `#0D0C0B` | Inside the library frame and the settings panel |\n| `--library-text-soft` | `#C9C1B6` | Secondary text: inactive sidebar labels, metadata, tags, the \"Nearby\" heading (89 text layers) |\n| `--nav-label-active` | `#F0E9DF` | The active sidebar label |\n\nI first named the third one a nav-label token, but the colour turned out to be used well beyond the sidebar, so I named it for what it is: secondary text.\n\n**New radius tokens, which fix the confusing names**\n\n| Token | Value | Replaces |\n|---|---|---|\n| `--card-radius` | 20px | `--search-radius` on cards, plus the cards that had a plain 20px. All 38 cards now use it. |\n| `--row-radius` | 9px | `--button-radius-normal` on all 87 sidebar, Space and settings rows |\n| `--tile-radius` | 12px | The plain 12px on the small tiles in Similar |\n| `--frame-radius` | 16px | The two left corners of the library frame where it meets the sidebar |\n\nAfter the change, `--search-radius` is used only on search bars, and `--button-radius-normal` has no uses left in the redesign. I searched every old value again and none are left unbound.\n\nTwo spot-checked screens (the Similar tab and Settings · Archive) look unchanged after the rebind.\n\nI left three things alone on purpose:\n- **Card colours:** the article card's light paper and the quote card's gold text belong to those card types, so they stay with the card rather than becoming app-wide tokens.\n- **Single-use colours:** the avatar colour and the zoom pill, which is used once.\n- **The stray `t:4-0` reference** behind the item viewer: that's how Paper stores a token colour inside the background, not a bug.\n\nWhen you build this into the app, add these eight tokens to `:root` in `App.css` beside the existing ones."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":214,"cache_read_input_tokens":145411,"output_tokens":846,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":214,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":846,"cache_read_input_tokens":145411,"cache_creation_input_tokens":214,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":214},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgAnGK1kSymVzDhXfz71d","requestRef":"b43ac6f6-ec85-42d7-b8d5-777de49a1d17","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"paper","attributionMcpTool":"finish_working_on_nodes","type":"assistant","uuid":"8d3dad8b-757a-4f17-b89d-59242a2703e4","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:08:58.461Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui