{"parentUuid":"2c4475c0-f9f6-4bf3-8242-61bce3ee96f8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAoQoe31YqeaHsbdRDpk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Using html_render would need that tool loaded, but file paths for images might not work well in HTML — markdown embeds are simpler here.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":171869,"output_tokens":669,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":45},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":171869,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5858,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgAoQoKvrFHMog3q4sHUg","requestRef":"a24cfd1a-fb85-4f05-b38f-fcdf02932779","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1a0b1eea-05e6-48eb-8c8a-ccd290e7180c","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:23:58.411Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"1a0b1eea-05e6-48eb-8c8a-ccd290e7180c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAoQoe31YqeaHsbdRDpk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I made three versions of 2.1, each separating the image viewer from the side panel a different way. They sit to the right of 2.4 in the same row. I only changed the Resurf-style screen; 2.2 will copy whichever one you pick.\n\n**Current:** the viewer and the panel share the same background with nothing between them, so the panel looks like it's floating on the dot grid.\n![current](C:/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/chat-images/resurf-redesign/split0.jpg)\n\n**2.1a Hairline:** a 1px border-coloured line where the panel starts. It's the smallest change and matches the hairline already on the frame.\n![hairline](C:/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/chat-images/resurf-redesign/splitA.jpg)\n\n**2.1b Panel matches sidebar:** the panel uses the darker app background, so the darker sidebar and panel sit either side of the lighter viewer. It's subtle, and it reuses the corner-frame idea without adding a line.\n![panel matches sidebar](C:/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/chat-images/resurf-redesign/splitB.jpg)\n\n**2.1c Viewer as inset stage:** the viewer becomes its own rounded, slightly lighter panel with a border, inset 8px inside the frame. The panel sits outside it on the plain frame colour. This one makes the split the clearest.\n![inset stage](C:/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/chat-images/resurf-redesign/splitC.jpg)\n\nI'd lean toward **2.1c**: it reads instantly and the image feels framed. **2.1b** is the quietest if 2.1c feels like too many boxes. They also combine well: 2.1b's darker panel with 2.1a's hairline is an easy middle ground if you want it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":171869,"output_tokens":669,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":45},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":171869,"cache_creation_input_tokens":365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":365},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgAoQoKvrFHMog3q4sHUg","requestRef":"a24cfd1a-fb85-4f05-b38f-fcdf02932779","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"25e18e45-1166-46fc-a009-77b35cdd16a8","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:23:58.499Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
