{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","id":"1ca0ed36-f531-483f-b7fc-06cd2ae692ea","timestamp":"2026-10-19T05:47:40.487Z","version":"2.1.303","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"393849d7c89755282473547105e9b0e84221e1094921669c601bb40892e020c7","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"summarized"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"low"}},"base":"a8c9fc59-d634-4250-ab14-f3c2bb13067a","keep":14,"tail":["359f55eb7ff99537d60930831072034a79570ce750290784dfb907bffd114082","4d0cc4f6f22f97b27b2cad9c173fafa79fc63c16ed284fab2229c87332e7e389","4b8bd9022e1f1d78333fcd370681ee79d1655b97a52c14e0e30360c64fe2dca4"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",16,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"52630a8ff7b1b5eb88a930416787a5c34ae9a86ac3396958a43458deb081623d"}
{"parentUuid":"173753a0-2068-4d49-95c8-e6484c840a7e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgB4xLeiReFpF4Qz6QU5f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm planning a self-contained HTML prototype with click-to-expand interactions, using CSS gradients instead of images for the card placeholders to keep things simple, and sketching the layout with two demos stacked within a 728px width.\n\nFor the open animation, I'm working out a FLIP technique: measuring each card's bounding rect, cloning it as an overlay, then animating it to the target rect using the Web Animations API — with mode-specific target shapes (rounded stage with border and sliding panel for \"c\", fitted viewer with crossfade and hairline panel for \"a\"). I'm structuring each demo's markup with sidebar, grid, and detail sections, keeping the detail view hidden until a card is clicked and computing relative rects for the morph target.\n\nWriting the open animation logic...\n\nStill defining layout details...\n\nI'll close on clicking the morph element, pressing Esc, or using a close button in the panel, then write the supporting JS: helper functions for computing relative positions, converting to pixel styles, and fitting an image into a box while preserving aspect ratio and padding.\n\nFor the morph transitions, I'm mapping the card's image rect to either the stage view (contain within the stage area accounting for border) or the full viewer (contain within the viewer rect), using the element's data-ar attribute to preserve its aspect ratio, then animating the outer and inner elements between those rects.\n\nI'm setting up the open/close animations: panel content slides in with a slight delay, grid items fade and scale down, and viewer dots fade in, with a busy flag to prevent animation stacking and canceling prior animations before starting new ones. I'm also keeping detail panel elements at opacity 0 by default in CSS, toggling pointer-events based on open state, and letting the fill:'forwards' animations set the final visible state.\n\nI'm hiding the card during open and restoring visibility after close, adding mode labels and a slow-motion toggle, and sizing the layout to fit two 400px windows plus headers. I'll skip the preview step and render the HTML directly at around 920px height to save time, accepting some risk of JS errors going unchecked.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":894,"cache_read_input_tokens":49476,"output_tokens":6132,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2825},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":894,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":6132,"cache_read_input_tokens":49476,"cache_creation_input_tokens":894,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":894},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":35821,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgB4xLLMruac1ome7rcvD","requestRef":"1ca0ed36-f531-483f-b7fc-06cd2ae692ea","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6362acfe-4e90-4220-88c8-49be9631571e","timestamp":"2026-10-19T05:50:09.275Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"6362acfe-4e90-4220-88c8-49be9631571e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgB4xLeiReFpF4Qz6QU5f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014QWaW6BN2QCQYjNkGB6Mrb","name":"mcp__t3-code__html_render","input":{"title":"Open / close motion: a vs c","height":930,"html":"<!doctype html><html><head><style>\n.bar{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;font:13px var(--font-sans);color:var(--muted-foreground);margin-bottom:12px}\n.bar label{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;cursor:pointer}\nh3{font:600 13px var(--font-sans);color:var(--foreground);margin:18px 0 8px}\nh3 span{font-weight:400;color:var(--muted-foreground)}\n.win{position:relative;height:380px;display:flex;background:#0A0A09;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;padding:8px 0 0 0;box-sizing:border-box}\n.side{width:56px;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box}\n.side i{display:block;height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:#1B1917}\n.frame{position:relative;flex:1;background:#0D0C0B;border:1px solid #262221;border-right:0;border-radius:16px 0 0 16px;overflow:hidden}\n.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;padding:16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);grid-auto-rows:120px;gap:12px;transform-origin:center}\n.card{border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #262221;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;background:#161412}\n.card .img{width:100%;height:100%}\n.detail{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;pointer-events:none}\n.viewer{position:relative;flex:1}\n.win[data-mode=c] .viewer{margin:8px 0 8px 8px}\n.win[data-mode=a] .viewer .dots{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgb(42,38,35) 1px,transparent 1.2px) 0 0/18px 18px}\n.panel{width:190px;flex-shrink:0;padding:18px 16px;box-sizing:border-box;opacity:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n.win[data-mode=a] .panel{border-left:1px solid #262221}\n.panel b{display:block;height:12px;width:80%;border-radius:4px;background:#E5DDD2;opacity:.85}\n.panel i{display:block;height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:#8D867C;opacity:.5}\n.panel .x{align-self:flex-end;font:14px var(--font-sans);color:#8D867C;cursor:pointer;pointer-events:auto}\n.morph{position:absolute;display:none;cursor:zoom-out;overflow:hidden;z-index:2}\n.win[data-mode=c] .morph{background:#121110;border:1px solid #262221;box-sizing:border-box}\n.morph .img{position:absolute}\n.hint{font:12px var(--font-sans);color:var(--muted-foreground);margin-top:6px}\n</style></head><body>\n<div class=\"bar\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"slow\"> Slow motion (3×)</label><span>Click a card to open. Click the image, the ×, or press Esc to close.</span></div>\n<h3>c · Viewer as inset stage <span>(the card grows into the box)</span></h3>\n<div class=\"win\" data-mode=\"c\"></div>\n<h3>a · Hairline <span>(the image grows into open space)</span></h3>\n<div class=\"win\" data-mode=\"a\"></div>\n<script>\nconst imgs=[[\"linear-gradient(135deg,#B0714F,#3a2418)\",4/3],[\"linear-gradient(160deg,#6d7a6a,#1e2620)\",3/4],[\"linear-gradient(120deg,#c9b79a,#5b4a36)\",16/10],[\"linear-gradient(200deg,#4f6070,#141a20)\",1],[\"linear-gradient(140deg,#8a5a6a,#2a1a20)\",3/4],[\"linear-gradient(110deg,#d4c3a8,#7a6040)\",4/3],[\"linear-gradient(170deg,#5d5048,#1a1614)\",16/9],[\"linear-gradient(130deg,#7a8a9a,#2a3038)\",4/5]];\nconst slow=document.getElementById('slow');const E='cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)';\nconst D=()=>slow.checked?1350:450;\nconst rel=(el,fr)=>{const r=el.getBoundingClientRect();return{left:r.left-fr.left,top:r.top-fr.top,width:r.width,height:r.height}};\nconst px=o=>({left:o.left+'px',top:o.top+'px',width:o.width+'px',height:o.height+'px'});\nconst contain=(b,ar,p)=>{let w=b.width-p*2,h=w/ar;if(h>b.height-p*2){h=b.height-p*2;w=h*ar}return{left:b.left+(b.width-w)/2,top:b.top+(b.height-h)/2,width:w,height:h}};\nconst wins=[];\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.win').forEach(win=>{\n const mode=win.dataset.mode;\n win.innerHTML=`<div class=\"side\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\">${imgs.map((g,i)=>`<div class=\"card\" data-i=\"${i}\"><div class=\"img\" style=\"background:${g[0]}\"></div></div>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"detail\"><div class=\"viewer\"><div class=\"dots\"></div></div><div class=\"panel\"><span class=\"x\">×</span><b></b><i style=\"width:50%\"></i><i></i><i style=\"width:70%\"></i><i style=\"width:85%\"></i><i style=\"width:40%\"></i></div></div><div class=\"morph\"><div class=\"img\"></div></div></div>`;\n const fr=win.querySelector('.frame'),grid=win.querySelector('.grid'),viewer=win.querySelector('.viewer'),panel=win.querySelector('.panel'),dots=win.querySelector('.dots'),morph=win.querySelector('.morph'),mimg=morph.querySelector('.img');\n const st={open:false,busy:false};\n function run(fwd){\n  const d=D(),c=st.card,ar=imgs[c.dataset.i][1],F=fr.getBoundingClientRect();\n  const from=rel(c,F),v=rel(viewer,F);let anims=[];\n  const k=(a,b)=>fwd?[a,b]:[b,a];\n  if(mode==='c'){\n   const inner=contain({left:0,top:0,width:v.width,height:v.height},ar,22);\n   anims.push(morph.animate(k({...px(from),borderRadius:'20px'},{...px(v),borderRadius:'20px'}),{duration:d,easing:E,fill:'forwards'}));\n   anims.push(mimg.animate(k({left:'0px',top:'0px',width:from.width-2+'px',height:from.height-2+'px',borderRadius:'0px'},{...px(inner),borderRadius:'8px'}),{duration:d,easing:E,fill:'forwards'}));\n  }else{\n   const t=contain(v,ar,26);\n   anims.push(morph.animate(k({...px(from),borderRadius:'20px'},{...px(t),borderRadius:'8px'}),{duration:d,easing:E,fill:'forwards'}));\n   mimg.style.inset='0';\n   anims.push(dots.animate(k({opacity:0},{opacity:1}),{duration:d*.7,delay:fwd?d*.2:0,easing:'ease',fill:'forwards'}));\n  }\n  anims.push(grid.animate(k({opacity:1,transform:'scale(1)'},{opacity:0,transform:'scale(.97)'}),{duration:d*.6,delay:fwd?0:d*.4,easing:'ease',fill:'forwards'}));\n  anims.push(panel.animate(k({opacity:0,transform:'translateX(28px)'},{opacity:1,transform:'none'}),{duration:d*.8,delay:fwd?d*.25:0,easing:E,fill:'forwards'}));\n  return Promise.all(anims.map(a=>a.finished));\n }\n const open=async c=>{if(st.busy||st.open)return;st.busy=true;st.card=c;mimg.style.background=c.firstChild.style.background;morph.style.display='block';c.style.visibility='hidden';win.querySelector('.detail').style.pointerEvents='auto';await run(true);st.open=true;st.busy=false};\n const close=async()=>{if(st.busy||!st.open)return;st.busy=true;await run(false);morph.getAnimations().concat(mimg.getAnimations()).forEach(a=>a.cancel());morph.style.display='none';st.card.style.visibility='';win.querySelector('.detail').style.pointerEvents='none';st.open=false;st.busy=false};\n grid.addEventListener('click',e=>{const c=e.target.closest('.card');if(c)open(c)});\n morph.addEventListener('click',close);panel.querySelector('.x').addEventListener('click',close);\n wins.push(close);\n});\naddEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')wins.forEach(f=>f())});\n</script></body></html>"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":894,"cache_read_input_tokens":49476,"output_tokens":6132,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2825},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":894,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":6132,"cache_read_input_tokens":49476,"cache_creation_input_tokens":894,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":894},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_014QWaW6BN2QCQYjNkGB6Mrb":{"title":"Open / close motion: a vs c","height":930,"html":"<!doctype h