{"parentUuid":"49158cc9-41a2-4703-9b20-da5570f2f9c7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBY5aNYXwYrLJrNBggYA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FB2i1eMb2hJoQ3irg5HpJM","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://github.com/conorluddy/LiquidGlassReference","prompt":"What is this repo, what's it for, who is the audience? Any web-applicable info?"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":729,"cache_read_input_tokens":41151,"output_tokens":1044,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":729,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1044,"cache_read_input_tokens":41151,"cache_creation_input_tokens":729,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":729},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01FB2i1eMb2hJoQ3irg5HpJM":{"url":"https://github.com/conorluddy/LiquidGlassReference","prompt":"What is this repo, what's it for, who is the audience? Any web-applicable info?"}},"apiBlockIndex":7,"requestId":"req_011CgBY5a4wNRD2rSbgvc3H3","requestRef":"49e19019-fd3e-4a57-9ccf-ad0317480ef5","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"50c0f6c8-1f0c-45f1-969b-ab50b0ffb5e1","timestamp":"2026-10-19T11:43:32.147Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"44895950-0715-48fb-9932-0f7ef209814f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a4301142-ad55-4a12-a4fe-231d1eb4dad2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EVDdz8wUuUXgfTUDwYZ3xJ","type":"tool_result","content":"**Rendering:** The renderer uses WebGPU. The README says \"The liquid-glass renderer requires WebGPU,\" and Three integrations need \"Three's WebGPU renderer, not WebGLRenderer.\" It doesn't mention WebGL, SVG, or CSS rendering. DOM content is captured with the experimental HTML-in-Canvas API, using `<canvas layoutsubtree>` and paint events to copy live DOM into GPU textures.\n\n**Live/scrolling content behind glass:** The README doesn't say how scrolling or animated content behind the glass is handled. The DOM-capture approach suggests live DOM is supported, but the page doesn't confirm it.\n\n**Performance notes:** The page has no benchmarks or performance guidance. It links to `ADAPTIVE_BLUR_PERF.md`, but that file's contents aren't included here.\n\n**Dependencies and framework requirements:**\n- `@liquid-dom/core` has no framework requirement, and `@liquid-dom/layout` is renderer-agnostic.\n- `@liquid-dom/react` needs React 19.\n- `@liquid-dom/three` needs `three` and `@liquid-dom/core`.\n- `@liquid-dom/r3f` needs `@react-three/fiber` plus the React and Three packages.\n- The monorepo uses pnpm.\n\n**License:** MIT.\n\n**Maturity:** The project has 2.6k stars, 122 forks, 201 commits, and changesets/release tooling. The README doesn't label it stable or beta. The HTML-in-Canvas dependency is described as experimental.\n\n**Browser support:**\n- Rendering requires a browser with `navigator.gpu`.\n- DOM-backed `Html` content also requires Chrome's Canvas Draw Element flag (`chrome://flags/#canvas-draw-element`).\n- No other browsers are mentioned."}]},"uuid":"b41d402b-8bc2-4686-a562-3a632083a276","timestamp":"2026-10-19T11:43:33.718Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":307815,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Rendering:** The renderer uses WebGPU. The README says \"The liquid-glass renderer requires WebGPU,\" and Three integrations need \"Three's WebGPU renderer, not WebGLRenderer.\" It doesn't mention WebGL, SVG, or CSS rendering. DOM content is captured with the experimental HTML-in-Canvas API, using `<canvas layoutsubtree>` and paint events to copy live DOM into GPU textures.\n\n**Live/scrolling content behind glass:** The README doesn't say how scrolling or animated content behind the glass is handled. The DOM-capture approach suggests live DOM is supported, but the page doesn't confirm it.\n\n**Performance notes:** The page has no benchmarks or performance guidance. It links to `ADAPTIVE_BLUR_PERF.md`, but that file's contents aren't included here.\n\n**Dependencies and framework requirements:**\n- `@liquid-dom/core` has no framework requirement, and `@liquid-dom/layout` is renderer-agnostic.\n- `@liquid-dom/react` needs React 19.\n- `@liquid-dom/three` needs `three` and `@liquid-dom/core`.\n- `@liquid-dom/r3f` needs `@react-three/fiber` plus the React and Three packages.\n- The monorepo uses pnpm.\n\n**License:** MIT.\n\n**Maturity:** The project has 2.6k stars, 122 forks, 201 commits, and changesets/release tooling. The README doesn't label it stable or beta. The HTML-in-Canvas dependency is described as experimental.\n\n**Browser support:**\n- Rendering requires a browser with `navigator.gpu`.\n- DOM-backed `Html` content also requires Chrome's Canvas Draw Element flag (`chrome://flags/#canvas-draw-element`).\n- No other browsers are mentioned.","durationMs":7747,"url":"https://github.com/AndrewPrifer/liquid-dom"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"44895950-0715-48fb-9932-0f7ef209814f","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
