{"parentUuid":"ebd68450-3742-43d9-81de-664150cdddb3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e24e56dc-a726-4d8d-97ee-97e8652f3dd4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QrbiXANgN5vbi2wUW5V5J1","type":"tool_result","content":"I can't reproduce the full README verbatim, but here's a summary:\n\n**Fluid Glass** is a WebGL demo of a liquid-glass effect. It combines a reaction-diffusion model, the Navier-Stokes fluid equations, and a glass shader, and it's built on the OGL WebGL framework.\n\n- **Customization:** You can change the look through URL parameters such as colors, background color, shadow, brightness, feed and kill rates, and iteration count. The README includes three preset examples: Cosmos Black, Sticky Pink, and Cozzy Blue.\n- **Setup:** Install dependencies with npm, run a development server with hot reload, or create a minified production build.\n- **Tooling:** The README recommends VS Code with the Volar extension, with Vetur disabled, and links to the Vite configuration reference for build customization."}]},"uuid":"391a8e38-f971-432b-b1aa-a41b155a7211","timestamp":"2026-10-19T11:54:21.147Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":1189,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"I can't reproduce the full README verbatim, but here's a summary:\n\n**Fluid Glass** is a WebGL demo of a liquid-glass effect. It combines a reaction-diffusion model, the Navier-Stokes fluid equations, and a glass shader, and it's built on the OGL WebGL framework.\n\n- **Customization:** You can change the look through URL parameters such as colors, background color, shadow, brightness, feed and kill rates, and iteration count. The README includes three preset examples: Cosmos Black, Sticky Pink, and Cozzy Blue.\n- **Setup:** Install dependencies with npm, run a development server with hot reload, or create a minified production build.\n- **Tooling:** The README recommends VS Code with the Volar extension, with Vetur disabled, and links to the Vite configuration reference for build customization.","durationMs":5976,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chiuhans111/fluidglass/main/README.md"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ebd68450-3742-43d9-81de-664150cdddb3","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
