{"parentUuid":"b46183c7-de9c-49bb-969a-1cca01b00364","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBZpaya8VgWJPZpJt9Sc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"At 75Hz the display refresh is 13.33ms, and the CSS version shows zero jank while the glass version has five hitches up to 120ms, likely from image decode or texture upload as cards scroll in — I should show both screenshots and note that the demo renders every frame even at idle rather than on demand. I'm also thinking the fluidglass look is appealing since it's a continuous fluid sim, and its shading fragment could be borrowed just for the visual style.\n\nI'll embed the screenshots using markdown per the instructions, and compare the result against the CSS-mid version.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":907,"cache_read_input_tokens":84313,"output_tokens":1196,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":208},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":907,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1196,"cache_read_input_tokens":84313,"cache_creation_input_tokens":907,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":907},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":10217,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBZpabWZHvnVHLGoXZ2D","requestRef":"0a222f95-d872-4f1a-81bb-23aa04f5e107","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1d0e8685-20b2-4aaf-83f9-8e4f11367fed","timestamp":"2026-10-19T12:06:24.265Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"1d0e8685-20b2-4aaf-83f9-8e4f11367fed","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBZpaya8VgWJPZpJt9Sc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm done testing. liquid-dom runs in our version of Electron, and here's how it compares with plain CSS glass.\n\n**liquid-dom**, with real refraction over the live, scrolling grid:\n![liquid-dom glass over a scrolling inkling grid](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\ink-glass-mid.jpg)\n\n**Plain CSS glass** (`backdrop-filter`), same page:\n![CSS backdrop-filter glass over the same grid](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\ink-css-mid.jpg)\n\n## What I found\n- **It works in our Electron with one line.** Electron 44 runs Chromium 152, and the experimental API is available once we add `app.commandLine.appendSwitch('enable-blink-features', 'CanvasDrawElement')`. Users never touch a flag, because we ship the browser. That removes my main objection from before.\n- **The look is clearly better.** The search bar bends the cards at its edges like real glass. CSS can only blur.\n- **Performance, scrolling for 4 seconds on this 75Hz display:**\n\n  | | Average frame | Hitches (>25ms) | Worst frame | JS cost per frame |\n  |---|---|---|---|---|\n  | CSS glass | 13.3ms | 0 | 13.7ms | ~0ms |\n  | liquid-dom | 14.3ms | 5 | **120ms** | 1.6ms |\n\n  The hitches are visible stutters, most likely when new card images scroll in and have to be uploaded to the GPU. That's the kind of dropped frame AGENTS.md says users should never notice.\n- **It redraws every frame by default.** Its demos run a loop that never stops, which breaks our rule against animations that keep repainting. We'd have to redraw only while scrolling or while something is moving. That should be doable, but it's our code to write and test.\n- **Risk:** it depends on an experimental Chrome API that could change or be removed in a future Electron upgrade. Electron also logged a GPU error when the window closed. The fallback would be the CSS version, so the app wouldn't break, it would just lose the effect.\n\n**About fluidglass:** I agree it looks the most real. That comes from its glass shader, the refraction and light at the edges. The fluid simulation underneath is what makes it run constantly. Its shader is the part we'd borrow, not its engine.\n\n**What I'd suggest:** liquid-dom for the search bar and zoom pill, with redrawing only while scrolling, as an experiment we can switch off and fall back to CSS. First I'd want to get those stutters down, for example by redrawing only on change and keeping images uploaded to the GPU between frames, then measure again. Want me to try that? Everything is in a scratch folder outside the repo (`%TEMP%\\glassproto`), so nothing in inkling has changed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":907,"cache_read_input_tokens":84313,"output_tokens":1196,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":208},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":907,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1196,"cache_read_input_tokens":84313,"cache_creation_input_tokens":907,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":907},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgBZpabWZHvnVHLGoXZ2D","requestRef":"0a222f95-d872-4f1a-81bb-23aa04f5e107","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"aecfcb8c-a4fd-49eb-901b-d0f70679f49c","timestamp":"2026-10-19T12:06:26.666Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
