{"parentUuid":"456ff5b3-11f1-4e96-afb2-9833f83d0c64","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBa2bRCnyGqWokuB8Ets","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm thinking the stutter probably comes from re-copying the full viewport texture on every scroll paint plus the adaptive blur filter running over the whole backdrop each time, rather than the image decode itself. I should measure this instead of guessing which part is the bottleneck.\n\nI'll test rendering only on paint/scroll events instead of continuously, preloading images with async decoding to isolate decode jank, and running a longer 8-second benchmark to separate individual frames. I want to implement glass, glass-demand, and glass-demand-predecoded modes, then check idle GPU usage by counting renders per second -- also watching for the risk that triggering a render on paint could itself cause a paint, creating a feedback loop.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2230,"cache_read_input_tokens":87446,"output_tokens":1718,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":381},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2230,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1718,"cache_read_input_tokens":87446,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2230,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2230},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7310,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBa2b7r6Y6ivkF6JgnNb","requestRef":"dbd271a9-5ec6-4c65-9349-f78a32c524f9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","u