{"parentUuid":"49e3fd77-f514-4969-9671-0a0deb53b22c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBaJir8ER8NdnTEFe8M3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"That's fixed now. The test scroll was programmatic and smooth, but this was a single run on this particular machine (75Hz, decent GPU), and the real app also virtualizes so results may differ there. The earlier full-size seed image was just a scratch artifact, nothing to worry about.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1690,"cache_read_input_tokens":96333,"output_tokens":943,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":94},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1690,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":943,"cache_read_input_tokens":96333,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1690,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1690},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":8520,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBaJiVJ5sPFxrSA68Qrn","requestRef":"aaaee0a4-0fe3-4c90-ba46-cf3ac2f882d8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ee327d54-ba05-460c-a4c6-1c539b34793f","timestamp":"2026-10-19T12:12:44.212Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"ee327d54-ba05-460c-a4c6-1c539b34793f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBaJir8ER8NdnTEFe8M3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both problems are fixed in the prototype, and liquid-dom now scrolls as smoothly as the plain CSS version.\n\n![liquid-dom glass with thumbnails, redrawn only on change](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\ink-glass-demand-thumb-mid.jpg)\n\nEach run scrolls for 4 seconds on this 75Hz display:\n\n| Setup | Average frame | Hitches (>25ms) | Worst frame | Glass redraws while idle |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| liquid-dom as it ships | 14.4ms | 5 | 133ms | **75/sec** |\n| + redraw only on change | 14.3ms | 5 | 120ms | ~0 |\n| + images decoded in advance | 14.5ms | 5 | 133ms | 0 |\n| + **thumbnails** | **13.3ms** | **0** | **13.6ms** | ~0 |\n| plain CSS glass | 13.3ms | 0 | 14.4ms | 0 |\n\n**What fixed what:**\n1. **Constant redrawing:** I only redraw the glass after a scroll or after the page repaints. With nothing moving it does nothing, which meets the AGENTS.md rule. It's about 10 lines around the library and needs no changes inside it.\n2. **The stutters:** the demo images were the originals at up to 6000×4000. The copy of the page behind the glass had to redraw each one as it scrolled in. Shrunk to 560px wide, the stutters are gone. Decoding them in advance didn't help; their size was the problem. The real grid already uses thumbnails, so this matches how inkling works.\n\n**Caveats:**\n- I tested one machine with an automated, perfectly smooth scroll. I haven't tried a weak laptop GPU, a 144Hz display, or real wheel and trackpad scrolling.\n- The app's card grid is virtualized, and I haven't tested a virtualized grid inside liquid-dom's copy of the page.\n- The experimental-API risk is unchanged. We'd need the CSS version as an automatic fallback.\n\n**My recommendation:** it's good enough to be worth trying in the real app as an experiment. Start with only the search bar and zoom pill, behind a check that falls back to CSS glass. If you want, I'll add a short note to this redesign's plan, or move on to mocking the glass look into the Paper frames. Everything is still in `%TEMP%\\glassproto`, and nothing in the repo has changed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1690,"cache_read_input_tokens":96333,"output_tokens":943,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":94},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1690,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":943,"cache_read_input_tokens":96333,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1690,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1690},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgBaJiVJ5sPFxrSA68Qrn","requestRef":"aaaee0a4-0fe3-4c90-ba46-cf3ac2f882d8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8e15aa50-4857-46d7-a6a5-f488dc7c38d9","timestamp":"2026-10-19T12:12:44.363Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
