{"parentUuid":"6a4f6ebf-c776-46b7-9124-8a4f679d20f9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBayprd72a2L5yiYhuV7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't add a real comment: Paper's tools let me read and resolve comment threads but not create them. Instead I put a yellow sticky note on the \"resurf redesign\" page, to the right of 1.3 Search.\n\n![Sticky note with the liquid glass findings](C:\\Users\\chris\\.claude\\projects\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tool-results\\mcp-paper-blob-1792412481662-fyfice.jpg)\n\nIt covers:\n- **Which library:** liquid-dom, and the one-line setting that makes it work in Electron.\n- **Where the glass goes:** only the search bar and zoom pill.\n- **When it redraws:** only after a scroll or a repaint.\n- **Images:** thumbnails only, since full-size originals caused the stutters.\n- **Fallback:** CSS glass when liquid-dom isn't available.\n- **The look we're aiming for:** fluidglass's edges and refraction.\n- **What's still untested.**\n\nThe bold labels at the start of each line didn't come through, but the note reads fine without them. If you'd rather have it as a real comment, you can paste the text into one and delete the note."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":232,"cache_read_input_tokens":115688,"output_tokens":418,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":232,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":418,"cache_read_input_tokens":115688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":232,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":232},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallb