{"parentUuid":"bc0c755f-2825-4a54-87f4-15f4a2e08fc1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBcKuu9gDtrD4KKQfYAL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added a new **§5 Liquid glass** row under the mascot section. It has copies of the library, search and item frames, so you can compare them with the originals, which I didn't change.\n\n**5.1 Library:** the toolbar now floats over the grid. The grid is scrolled a little so cards pass under it. Back/forward, grid/list and search are glass.\n![5.1 Library with glass toolbar](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\glass51.jpg)\n\n**5.2 Search:** the search bar is glass, and the dark gradient that used to sit behind it is gone. It's the most visible glass in the set.\n![5.2 Search bar as glass](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\glass52.jpg)\n\n**5.3 Item:** the photo is zoomed to 140% so it runs under the controls. The more button and zoom pill are glass. The back/forward pill is glass too, but it sits over the empty stage rather than the photo.\n![5.3 Item view with glass controls](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\glass53.jpg)\n\nThe glass recipe:\n- A translucent dark tint with blur and boosted saturation.\n- A brighter rim along the top edge and a soft inner shadow at the bottom.\n- A drop shadow underneath.\n\nPaper can blur what's behind an element, but it can't bend it. So these show the CSS fallback look. The real liquid-dom version would also distort the image at the edges, like in the prototype screenshot.\n\nA few things I left alone on purpose:\n- **Kept solid:** the sidebar, inspector panel and Add button, so the glass stays limited to controls that float over content.\n- **Title text:** the \"Everything\" and item titles got a soft shadow instead of a glass pill, so they stay readable over photos."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":287,"cache_read_input_tokens":174205,"output_tokens":646,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":287,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":646,"cache_read_input_tokens":174205,"cache_creation_input_tokens":287,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":287},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBcKuA1FwiBZwSdXPLgZ","requestRef":"2fdc2a90-ae62-448b-8245-61d4148a4e3b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ce3ae2ac-149c-4cc4-aa12-532b1eab2594","timestamp":"2026-10-19T12:39:11.529Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
