{"parentUuid":"9e388b71-7f14-47cf-92eb-efcaa2fa8316","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBdcxmdXLPiDh2WCEpz3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've applied the dark glass to all seven redesign screens, and checked 1.3 and 2.3 in screenshots: the glass reads as dark and nothing broke. I haven't looked at the other five since the change.\n\n**What changed on each screen:**\n- **1.1 Library:** the toolbar floats, so the grid scrolls under it. Back/forward, grid/list and search are glass.\n- **1.2 Search drops in:** the search bar is glass and the dark gradient behind it is gone. The toolbar floats like in 1.1.\n- **1.3 Search, query pinned:** the toolbar pills and the \"lanterns at night\" query chip are glass. Only 6 results fit below the toolbar, so nothing passes under the glass here. It shows as subtle dark pills.\n- **2.1–2.4 Item views:** back/forward, the more button and the zoom pill are glass. The photo stays at the original 80% zoom, so the glass mostly sits over the dark stage. Only 5.3 has the 140% zoom where the photo runs under the controls.\n\n**What stays solid:** the sidebar, inspector panels and Add button. The settings screens have no controls floating over content, so I didn't change them.\n\nThe §5 Liquid glass row is still on the page and now mostly duplicates these screens. Want me to delete it, or keep 5.3 as the zoomed-in example?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":334,"cache_read_input_tokens":200219,"output_tokens":450,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":334,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":450,"cache_read_input_tokens":200219,"cache_creation_input_t