{"parentUuid":"aad92c46-32af-4f66-bac3-da9bae25b355","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBdkHwkeWBF8SrvStL45","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The sidebar toggle is now glass, and I removed the extra plus. Both changes are on every screen, including the settings screens and the §5 copies.\n\n**About the plus:** it was a mistake I copied over from Resurf's sidebar. The current app has no add button in the sidebar, and the toolbar's **+ Add** already does the same job. So I deleted the plus from every header, leaving the toggle as a single round glass button.\n\n![Sidebar with the single glass toggle](C:\\Users\\chris\\.claude\\projects\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tool-results\\mcp-paper-blob-1792414659844-ox0m4l.jpg)\n\nThe toggle sits on the solid sidebar, so there's nothing behind it to blur. It shows the glass rim and depth but not the see-through look. That still keeps it consistent with the other glass buttons."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":198,"cache_read_input_tokens":211057,"output_tokens":323,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":198,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":323,"cache_read_input_tokens":211057,"cache_creation_input_tokens":198,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":198},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBdkHbewXmhW74QUCKXj","requestRef":"4bb15e97-d093-47dc-baad-39cf632672ab","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributi