{"parentUuid":"750ab960-6830-4ec7-8305-7e3dc6e6dd9d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBeAh6SxKj2SCZ6vvqmW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I made the tab bigger and lined it up with back and forward in Paper, on every screen. The prototype above now uses the flip instead of the squeeze.\n\n**In Paper:**\n- **Size:** the tab is now 26×34, the same height as the back/forward pill. The chevron is a little bigger too.\n- **Alignment:** its top now matches the pill's top on each screen, so the two read as one row. I checked this in the 2.1 screenshot.\n\n**In the prototype:**\n- **The flip:** the tab now swings like a page turning on a hinge at the frame's edge. It goes edge-on, crosses over, and lands flat on the other side.\n- **The chevron:** it no longer turns on its own. It points the other way only because the whole tab flipped.\n- **Back/forward:** I added the back/forward pill so you can see the tab sitting level with it. When the sidebar closes, the pill shifts right to make room for the tab inside the frame."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":198,"cache_read_input_tokens":249809,"output_tokens":308,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":198,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":308,"cache_read_input_tokens":249809,"cache_creation_input_tokens":198,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":198},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBeAgks8kFSqL4hXAf6D","requestRef":"0a592349-1a73-4468-b145-7b79c51e3178","r