{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","id":"010c6563-3c29-4524-ab2a-1b7c654531f6","timestamp":"2026-10-19T13:08:35.032Z","version":"2.1.303","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"bcd5e62b1c5bf69cec77484e91712120ae2329531adb56e5595b8f37b64e884f","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"summarized"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"low"}},"base":"c8bfba6f-e20e-4a91-b30d-a6385e3ade8e","keep":308,"tail":["8220add539a72fd60b0da2dedde8a3342d8de7f8f98b058bc4e18143f1a4b2ce","24e9fdd967020d73ac0aa1ea4c2c8df195f2e2f31597bb1d11c00b149146e7e6","a5299308ec7008e6ab2190cd775f7599ab9647737f939d22809f65b7482b9d73"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",310,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"d2e18deab3b3362ea5da6db7142d4cae1b96c657529de8e859d05f6429672278"}
{"parentUuid":"dcfe8d51-a7fa-4850-bfc3-7abbdf17676d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBeaR6we5CE6v1txjLGT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This is scaled down to fit the chat column. In the real 1440px layout the resting bar would be about 400px wide and the open search about 700px, the same as 1.2.\n\nThings to look at:\n- **Toolbar balance:** the toolbar now has two pills on the left, the search bar in the middle and **+ Add** on the right. There's no small round icon left floating at the top right.\n- **The mascot's eyes** sit at the left end of the bar while it's at rest. That gives the ink-blot a permanent home instead of only appearing during search.\n- **Opening search:** the bar grows in place, and the rest of the toolbar and the grid dim behind it. In this mockup the dimming fades in rather than snapping on. 1.2 has a dark gradient at the top in its place, and I can keep either one in Paper.\n- **The placeholder** names where you are, so it would read \"Search Japan trip\" inside that Space. That replaces the old centred title.\n\nI haven't built the results list that appears below the open bar. That's the part 1.2 and 1.3 already cover. If you like this direction, I'll put it into 1.1, 1.2 and 1.3 in Paper."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3582,"cache_read_input_tokens":255374,"output_tokens":377,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3582,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":377,"cache_read_input_tokens":255374,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3582,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3582},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard",