{"parentUuid":"43d3be33-4b73-4389-b871-027dfd76b68e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBj6oSQoZVcbSVaJERJG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The search pill is now in the Paper mockups.\n\n![1.1 with search pill](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\1.1-search-pill.jpg)\n\n- **At rest (1.1, 1.3, 3.1, 3.2 and the 5.1 copy):** the small search icon button is gone. The centered title is now a dark glass pill with a faint magnifier and \"Everything\". Every one of these screens shows \"Everything\", so none needed a Space name.\n- **Triggered (1.2 and the 5.2 copy):** the toolbar has no title and no search icon. The open search bar with the mascot eyes takes the pill's place, so it reads as the pill having grown into the bar.\n\nPaper can't animate, so the morph itself only exists in the earlier HTML mockup. Here it's just the two end states.\n\nShould I delete the §5 copies, or keep them? They now match the originals except for the edge tab."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":192,"cache_read_input_tokens":50542,"output_tokens":339,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":19},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":192,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":339,"cache_read_input_tokens":50542,"cache_creation_input_tokens":192,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":192},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgBj6o6L6E1saWmLBuqvT","requestRef":"d3c1c9e7-9ba6-4f0a-918a-8782a453ac89","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type