{"parentUuid":"f909fe13-89f4-4c2a-9bf4-a54827553e78","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBmXp4oEnXsHGVJ2uUak","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added a new screen, 2.3, to the item view row, next to 2.2. It's the lantern photo zoomed far in on the edge of one lantern, with sharp square pixels and a faint 1px grid between them, like Paper.\n\n![2.3 zoomed in](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\2.3-zoomed.jpg)\n\n- **Zoom level:** each image pixel is 16 screen pixels, so the zoom pill reads 1600%.\n- **Grid:** it's very faint (white at 8% opacity) and lines up exactly with the pixels. It disappears on the dark background on the right, the same way Paper's does.\n- **The rest of the screen** is the 5.3 glass item view as it is now, with the title pill, Close/esc and the new action bar.\n\nWhen this gets built, it should be cheap: switch the image to sharp pixel scaling and show a grid overlay only once each pixel is big enough on screen, so there's nothing extra to render and no animation."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":204,"cache_read_input_tokens":125512,"output_tokens":398,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":54},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":204,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":125512,"cache_creation_input_tokens":204,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":204},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgBmXokhNxke5UjFhdPgw","requestRef":"5f0d6b97-49f0-4802-8b87-f9