{"parentUuid":"6c2f40ed-fc80-4cb7-9ed3-61e7132fa2ec","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBnfo8qDdiQBsJuubrUj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should design the task for haiku subagents to clean up each artboard: renaming layers semantically, removing hidden/dead nodes, switching to flex layouts over absolute positioning where feasible, and applying tokens — all without any visual change. I need to verify before/after screenshots and split the work by artboard groups to run in parallel, while watching for the risk of concurrent edits colliding in shared areas.\n\nI'm grouping the artboards into clusters (1.x, 2.x, 3.x/4.1), setting aside the duplicate 5.x set as a question to flag rather than clean automatically. I also need to flag that deleting hidden spacer elements could shift layout if surrounding elements rely on flex grow/space-between — so I should instruct agents to only remove hidden nodes if the visual result matches exactly after comparison.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":315,"cache_read_input_tokens":132509,"output_tokens":3642,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":512},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":315,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3642,"cache_read_input_tokens":132509,"cache_creation_input_tokens":315,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":315},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7717,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBnfnn1BCF7i1vxRaEfE","requestRef":"0c250fbf-bd86-4