{"parentUuid":"5a60453b-bc64-49b2-a4f5-c763220d542a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBnfo8qDdiQBsJuubrUj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll split the cleanup across three Haiku agents, one per section, so they don't touch the same screens."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":315,"cache_read_input_tokens":132509,"output_tokens":3642,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":512},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":315,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3642,"cache_read_input_tokens":132509,"cache_creation_input_tokens":315,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":315},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgBnfnn1BCF7i1vxRaEfE","requestRef":"0c250fbf-bd86-4452-9e69-829027d0db4e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d1e62d58-ea8b-4dea-a22c-33abbc4ddb13","timestamp":"2026-10-19T14:54:51.179Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"d1e62d58-ea8b-4dea-a22c-33abbc4ddb13","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBnfo8qDdiQBsJuubrUj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XxCbGuPFsbZnEtD49mvKau","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Clean up §1 library/search screens","model":"haiku","prompt":"You are cleaning up the layer structure of Paper design mockups so they're easy to implement in code later. NO visual changes allowed.\n\nPaper file id: 01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW, page id: p-6-0 (\"resurf redesign\"). Always pass fileId and pageId.\nFirst call get_guide({topic:\"paper-mcp-instructions\"}) and read it.\n\nYour artboards ONLY (do not touch any other artboard; other agents are editing them concurrently):\n- \"1.1 Library\" (3YC-0)\n- \"1.2 Search · drops in\" (437-0)\n- \"1.3 Search · query pinned\" (484-0)\n\nSteps:\n1. get_screenshot of each artboard first and keep them as the \"before\" reference.\n2. get_tree_summary / get_jsx to inspect. Then clean up:\n   - Rename layers with generic names (\"Frame\", \"SVG\", \"Path\", \"Rect\", \"Circle\", text-derived names on containers) to clear semantic names like the existing convention: \"Toolbar\", \"Search pill\", \"Button · back\", \"Icon · search\", \"Space row · Kitchen\", \"Edge tab\". Use rename_nodes with updates:[{nodeId,name}].\n   - Delete dead nodes: nodes with visibility hidden or display none (e.g. old toolbar title text hidden behind the new glass \"Search pill\"), empty frames, and scrim/overlay nodes that are hidden. BEFORE deleting a hidden node that sits in a flex row, check if removing it would shift siblings (e.g. a space-between toolbar). If it would, either leave it or replace the layout so the result is pixel-identical; verify by screenshot.\n   - Where a raw hex color exactly equals a token, switch to the token var: --library-accent #B0714F, --library-border #262221, --library-canvas #0C0C0B, --library-muted #8D867C, --library-surface #161412, --library-surface-raised #1B1917, --library-text #E5DDD2, --app-background #0A0A09, --library-frame #0D0C0B, --library-text-soft #C9C1B6, --nav-label-active #F0E9DF. Only exact matches.\n   - Do not restructure working layouts just for style; do not change sizes, spacing, glass styles, images or text content.\n3. update_styles format: updates:[{nodeIds:[...], styles:{...}}]. Never set the \"background\" shorthand.\n4. get_screenshot of each artboard after, compare with before. If anything moved or changed, fix it.\n5. Call finish_working_on_nodes when done.\n\nReport back briefly: per artboard, what you renamed (counts), what you deleted (names), token swaps, and confirm before/after screenshots match. Do not show raw node ids except in the report."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":315,"cache_read_input_tokens":132509,"output_tokens":3642,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":512},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":315,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3642,"cache_read_input_tokens":132509,"cache_creation_input_tokens":315,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":315},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01XxCbGuPFsbZnEtD49mvKau":{"description":"Clean up §1 library/search screens","model":"haiku","prompt":"You are cleaning up the layer structure of Paper design mockups so they're easy to implement in code later. NO visual changes allowed.\n\nPaper file id: 01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW, page id: p-6-0 (\"resurf redesign\"). Always pass fileId and pageId.\nFirst call get_guide({topic:\"paper-mcp-i