{"parentUuid":"2a2803ab-8472-4dca-b41b-6fd4fd71d85c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBniACuHBHuM9XpxZJBu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've started three Haiku agents in the background, one per section:\n\n- **Library and search:** 1.1, 1.2, 1.3.\n- **Item view:** 2.1, 2.2, 2.3. They'll leave the pixel zoom note alone.\n- **Settings and mascot:** 3.1, 3.2, 4.1.\n\nEach one will:\n- rename generic layers (\"Frame\", \"SVG\", \"Path\") to clear names;\n- delete hidden leftovers, like the old toolbar titles behind the glass pills and the hidden \"⋯\" buttons;\n- swap raw hex colours for design tokens where they match exactly.\n\nNone of that should change how the screens look. Each agent screenshots before and after to confirm nothing moved.\n\nI left out the §5 glass copies (5.1–5.3). They duplicate the originals, and you haven't said whether to keep them. I'll check the agents' results and spot-check the screens when they finish, then we can start building in the app."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4927,"cache_read_input_tokens":132824,"output_tokens":315,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4927,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":315,"cache_read_input_tokens":132824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4927,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4927},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBni9pqStimDWEyhSXRN","requestRef":"f872a059-72a1-4bf7-87a4-5269c3578a83","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type"