 mascot eyes and bodies in every frame are now \"Mascot · eye left/right\", \"Mascot · body\", and \"Mascot · eyes\".\n- Deleted: none.\n- Token swaps: none.\n\n**Glass request (not applied)**\nThe coordinator asked for the dark liquid-glass recipe on the toolbar pills, the search pill, and the mascot search bar. That changes how those controls look, which contradicts \"NO visual changes allowed.\" I left them as they are. If you want the glass applied, please confirm and I will do it on those controls only.\n\n`finish_working_on_nodes` has been called for all three artboards.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>97405</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>17</tool_uses><duration_ms>70838</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
