{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-19T14:56:47.520Z","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>ab50d30e17353e678</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01XxCbGuPFsbZnEtD49mvKau</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tasks\\ab50d30e17353e678.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Clean up §1 library/search screens\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>All three artboards are cleaned up, and the after screenshots match the before set. The glass request is also handled.\n\n**Glass (coordinator request)**\n- Already had the recipe, left alone: back/forward pill, view toggle pill (active segment included), search pill (1.1 and 1.3), open search bar (1.2), query chip (1.3).\n- Added the recipe: the duration badges on the video card in 1.1 and 1.2. Their 1px borders may add about 2px to the badge size.\n- Not touched: the solid Add button, the sidebar, and the edge tabs.\n- I did not reference the 5.1 or 5.2 glass artboards from anything.\n\n**1.1 Library (3YC-0)**\n- Renamed about 50 layers, covering the collapse button and icon, logo parts, search pill and its icon, nav icons, grid/list cells, avatar, settings, and the everything-icon dots.\n- Deleted: \"Everything\" title text (hidden, under the search pill). Its toolbar row is space-between with two equal flex-grow side groups, so the edge-aligned content does not move.\n- Token swap: the edge tab background now uses `--library-frame`, which is the same #0D0C0B.\n\n**1.2 Search · drops in (437-0)**\n- Renamed about 25 layers, covering the collapse button, logo parts, and the search icon chain.\n- Deleted: \"Top scrim\" (display none, no children).\n- Token swap: the edge tab background now uses `--library-frame`.\n- Kept: \"Search bar · original style\". It is visible and it is the search bar on screen, so I did not treat it as dead.\n\n**1.3 Search · query pinned (484-0)**\n- Renamed about 15 layers, covering the collapse button, logo parts, search pill and icon, and the clear icon.\n- Deleted: \"Everything\" title text (hidden, under the search pill), same reasoning as 1.1.\n- Token swap: the edge tab background now uses `--library-frame`.\n\n**Not done**\n- Stroke token swaps (#C9C1B6, #8D867C, and similar) on SVG path strokes. I did not confirm that the stroke attribute can be changed through update_styles, so these are still raw hex.\n- Renaming the Path/Circle/Rect children inside the icons on 1.2 and 1.3. Those are still generic names.\n- The Spacer and Divider rectangles inside the quote card and note cards are kept. They read as semantic names.\n\n**Verification**\n- After screenshots of all three artboards look the same as the before set. The duration badge glass is subtle and I could not verify it closely at 1x.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>155025</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>28</tool_uses><duration_ms>108883</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
