{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-19T14:58:02.321Z","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a6ba8ab661b59e2ef</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_016UwSUhB2US3vECB9ED1uoU</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tasks\\a6ba8ab661b59e2ef.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Clean up §2 item view screens\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>The layer cleanup is done on all three artboards, but it is not pixel-identical. The toolbar titles in 2.1 and 2.2 moved and changed style because of the glass change you asked for. The 2.3 artboard is unchanged apart from renames and the removal of hidden nodes.\n\n**2.1 Item · Resurf-style inspector (4D5-0)**\n- Renamed about 60 layers. Containers: Close, Key hint · esc, Button · open original, Button · show in folder, Button · archive, Edge tab, Icon · chevron left, Icon · plus, Title pill. Icon SVGs got their names too. Leaf shapes became \"Icon shape\", \"Logo shape\" or \"Dot\".\n- Deleted: Button · more (hidden), which held three hidden circles.\n- Title: the toolbar text became a glass Title pill, copied from 2.3 and set to absolute centering, 34px tall, radius 17, padding 0 16px, 13px / 600 var(--library-text), with the recipe backdrop. Its center is about 14px left of the old position, and it is now centered in the toolbar. The title was 15px / 500 before, so the size and weight changed too.\n- Token swaps: edge tab background #0D0C0B to var(--library-frame). Stroke swaps: #C9C1B6 to var(--library-text-soft) on back, minus and plus glyphs; #8D867C to var(--library-muted) on the edge chevron. The #5E5850 forward chevron has no token, so it stayed.\n\n**2.2 Similar tab (5PB-0)**\n- Same renames, plus Close, Key hint · esc, and the action buttons and edge tab. The 2.2 action icons now use the same names as 2.1.\n- Deleted: Button · more (hidden).\n- Title pill: same as 2.1.\n- Token swaps: same as 2.1.\n\n**2.3 Pixel zoom (9C8-0)**\n- Renamed about 70 layers. Pixel grid for the SVG overlay, Pixel grid cells for its rect, and the same container and icon names as above.\n- Deleted: Button · more (hidden) and the hidden title text behind the pill. The title pill is already absolutely centered, so this does not move anything.\n- Token swaps: not done. I did not pull this artboard's JSX, so I did not check its hex values.\n- The \"Japanese lanterns\" image is only renamed.\n\n**Glass controls**\n- Glass on the 2.1 and 2.2 Title pill: new, as above.\n- Back/forward pill and zoom pill, in both 2.1 and 2.2: already matched your recipe exactly, so no change.\n- Sidebar, inspector and the open-state edge tab: left as they were, per your note.\n- The 2.3 pill I copied has no backdrop blur, so I added the blur to the copies in 2.1 and 2.2 to match the recipe. The 2.3 original was not changed.\n\n**Before/after**\n- The before/after screenshots show the same content and layout, except for the title change above.\n- I did not compare 2.3 against an earlier screenshot after the 2.3 rename pass. A single 2.3 screenshot was taken after the renames.\n\nLayers are renamed where generic names were left. The Japanese lantern image and the grid are not otherwise touched.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>158751</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>30</tool_uses><duration_ms>174936</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
