{"parentUuid":"03adc120-22e4-4fb6-8e66-009f17ecab26","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBnwbV3BSaWJj4ibsCSt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cleanup is finished, and I've deleted the separate liquid glass section: its header and screens 5.1, 5.2 and 5.3.\n\n**What the agents did**\n- **Layer names:** about 450 generic layers across all nine screens now have clear names, like \"Search pill\", \"Title pill\", \"Button · archive\" and \"Edge tab\". A few small icon shapes inside 1.2 and 1.3 still have generic names, which doesn't matter for building.\n- **Hidden leftovers:** these are gone from the library, search and item screens: the old titles under the pills, the hidden \"⋯\" buttons and an unused scrim. In 3.1 and 3.2 the hidden title stays, because removing it would shift the Add button.\n- **Design tokens:** some colours now use their tokens, including the edge tab colour and a few icon strokes on the item screens. Most other icon strokes are still raw hex values.\n\n**Glass**\n- Every floating control on the remaining screens now uses the dark glass.\n- The only real change was 2.1 and 2.2: their plain toolbar titles are now the same centered glass title pill as 2.3. I checked 2.1 and the pill is centered over the image.\n- One extra: the library agent also put glass on the small duration badge on video cards.\n\n**One stale spot**\nThe first frame of the mascot motion spec (4.1) still shows the old small search icon button. It's a motion reference rather than a real screen, so it doesn't block building. I can update it to the glass search pill whenever you like.\n\nThe mockups are ready for app work. Where do you want to start: the library toolbar with the glass search pill, the edge tab, or the item view?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":152468,"output_tokens":538,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":538,"cache_read_input_tokens":152468,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBnwb9xB6HAtwpPN1nJ1","requestRef":"62e3aece-2014-4249-ba0e-77541fe702c8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"paper","attributionMcpTool":"finish_working_on_nodes","type":"assistant","uuid":"de3a9e3b-9af5-437a-814c-8de9a1a6f5c1","timestamp":"2026-10-19T14:58:22.728Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
