{"parentUuid":"1acd600c-e872-45a6-a1bb-e17d753102b2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBovyicG7fSWS5dZ4qod","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'd suggest sequencing work so shared pieces land first: foundation (glass utility class, tokens) before the shell (toolbar, edge tab, sidebar), then the search pill morph, item view, settings, and pixel zoom last, each as its own focused PR. Liquid-dom work can wait as a separate effort, starting instead with a CSS backdrop-filter fallback.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_read_input_tokens":152719,"output_tokens":863,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":151},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":596,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":863,"cache_read_input_tokens":152719,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":596},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4460,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBovuJgzDZhayWwjUAo4","requestRef":"1f6694d7-9993-41ae-af9a-168b3c49684b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d768ebe3-2c72-430f-ab68-01ee2ea735ef","timestamp":"2026-10-19T15:11:20.878Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"d768ebe3-2c72-430f-ab68-01ee2ea735ef","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBovyicG7fSWS5dZ4qod","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go from shared pieces out to individual screens, one PR per step so each is easy to review.\n\n1. **Glass as a shared style.** Make one CSS class or token set from the dark glass recipe and use plain CSS `backdrop-filter`. Everything after this uses it, so it goes first. The WebGPU liquid-dom version can come much later as its own experiment. It's riskier and behind an experimental Chromium flag.\n\n2. **App shell: toolbar and edge tab.** Do the toolbar layout first: back/forward pill on the left, title in the middle, Add on the right. Then build the edge tab with its flip animation in place of the round sidebar toggle. Every screen sits inside this shell, so getting it right once fixes it everywhere.\n\n3. **Search pill, then the morph into the search bar.** This is the most visible change, and the search bar with the mascot eyes is already built. Do it in two steps: first the resting pill that opens the existing bar, then the grow animation. That way, if the morph needs tuning, it doesn't hold up the layout.\n\n4. **Item view.**\n   - Glass title pill and history pill.\n   - Close/esc in place of \"×\", and no more \"⋯\".\n   - The new action bar: open original, show in folder, archive.\n   - The \"Belongs to\" row.\n\n   It's mostly reshuffling controls that already exist, so it should be quick once steps 1 and 2 are in.\n\n5. **Settings.** It mostly inherits the shell and glass, so it's a small pass to restyle it to match 3.1 and 3.2.\n\n6. **Pixel zoom.** It's self-contained and nothing depends on it, so it goes last.\n\nDetail views for the other item types (article, PDF, note) aren't designed yet. We'd mock those up before step 4 touches them, or step 4 ships for images only.\n\nTo keep it moving, I'd do each step on its own branch, check it in preview (`bun run dev`) with the demo library, and you look at a screenshot before it becomes a PR. Steps 1–3 depend on each other, so they go in order. Steps 4–6 could run in parallel worktrees once the shell lands.\n\nWant me to start on step 1?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_read_input_tokens":152719,"output_tokens":863,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":151},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":596,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":863,"cache_read_input_tokens":152719,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":596},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgBovuJgzDZhayWwjUAo4","requestRef":"1f6694d7-9993-41ae-af9a-168b3c49684b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1b9120a7-8b00-4dc9-8143-89ffe20f2bda","timestamp":"2026-10-19T15:11:26.141Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"t3/redesign-resurf-inspired-ui","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
