{"parentUuid":"0c5273ec-2c47-487c-b585-079bc9158b1f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBpqQKeXA9WY9GkAAYje","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Step 1 is in place on a new branch, `feat/glass-surface`, but it isn't committed yet.\n\n![Preview with glass video badge](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\step1-glass-badge.png)\n\n- **Shared glass style:** the dark glass recipe from the mockups is now a `.glass` class plus three colour tokens in `src/App.css`. Later steps just add the class to a control.\n- **Where it shows today:** only the \"Video\" badge on video cards, bottom right of the grid in the screenshot. It used to have its own blur and is now on the shared style. In the preview its computed styles match the recipe exactly.\n- **Checks:** Biome passes on both changed files.\n\nThe app has fewer floating controls than the mockups yet. There's no back/forward pill or zoom pill, and the search bar gets reworked in step 3. So this step is only 17 lines, and the badge is the only thing a user would notice. I'd fold it into the step 2 branch rather than open a PR this small.\n\nThe preview server is still running on port 5173 for step 2: the toolbar layout and the edge tab. Shall I carry on?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":441,"cache_read_input_tokens":188799,"output_tokens":461,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":69},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":441,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":461,"cache_read_input_tokens":188799,"cache_creation_input_tokens":441,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":441},"type":"message"}],"speed":"