{"parentUuid":"596c848c-5052-44c5-ad97-5898d71af593","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01QN1ZuawLFYuJGZkXmP6pPC","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"40312512-f71f-4bfd-af1a-9c81ae2f9ab8","timestamp":"2026-10-19T15:51:50.649Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"40312512-f71f-4bfd-af1a-9c81ae2f9ab8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBs1B6vmC7t6G1q6WEBb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to decide what Escape does in the search bar—there's no handler currently. I'm thinking the simplest behavior is Escape just blurs the input while keeping the query visible (pinned), rather than clearing it immediately.\n\nI'm settling on: Esc clears the query and blurs, returning to the pill state; clicking outside blurs but keeps the query pinned. For the resting state, the kbd hint stays hidden until the bar opens, then shows \"esc to close,\" and the title falls back to the active space name or view name.\n\nI'm now updating the search field's JSX structure—adjusting the className logic for focus/resting/glass states, adding the eyes span and resting label with the search icon and title, then the input and the esc hint. I'm also reconsidering whether to keep the black wipe focus animation given the glass aesthetic from the approved mockup, but decide to keep it since it's part of the existing mascot effect.\n\nWriting the capture bar CSS...\n\nThe cleanest fix is to just move the .glass utility rule to the end of App.css so it naturally wins over earlier same-specificity component rules, rather than duplicating glass properties inline. I'll keep the existing black wipe overlay on .search-field::before, and leave the kbd element in the JSX untouched.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1038,"cache_read_input_tokens":238229,"output_tokens":1550,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1389},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1038,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_toke