{"parentUuid":"1f1447c0-cac9-4fe0-91ac-33dbab5ac9ff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBvpDBaxGaj2hcMzj17b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Step 3 is done: the search pill now opens into the full search bar and collapses back.\n\n**At rest** it's a small glass pill centered in the header, showing a search icon and the name of the current view (\"Everything\", or the open Space). Click it or focus it and it widens to 700px over about 0.3s.\n\n![resting](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\search-resting.png)\n\n**Open** with the query \"lanterns\", it filters to the one matching card. The hint on the right now reads \"esc to close\".\n\n![open](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\search-open.png)\n\nI checked this in preview:\n- **Escape** clears the query, drops focus, and the bar shrinks back to the pill.\n- **Clicking away with a query** keeps the bar open, so your results don't disappear.\n- **Phone-width windows** keep the old full-width bar.\n\nOne thing for you to decide: when the bar is focused, the mascot's black fill still covers the glass, so the open bar looks solid black instead of glass. I can keep the black (it makes the mascot stand out more) or drop it so the bar stays glass while you type. Which do you want?\n\nSteps 1–3 are uncommitted on `feat/glass-surface`. Next up is step 4, the item view."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1313,"cache_read_input_tokens":62913,"output_tokens":449,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1313,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":449,"cache_read_input_tokens":62913,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1313,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1313},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBvpCs13pUnYja2T1yVj","requestRef":"76d1ebd5-69b5-4798-b950-6ed9280adde4","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"287ac2a2-c142-4e72-a604-b2fd408e4c3f","timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:41:36.523Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
