{"parentUuid":"ec4d68f6-897d-4727-b622-59d8d6cb5329","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBwXDFCmyL3rbFbjTAZ7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm planning the dialog to cover the whole main-content rect with a grid layout splitting stage and inspector, and thinking the flight animation should move just the image rather than the entire dialog for simplicity.\n\nI can structure the dialog with absolutely positioned stage and inspector children: during flight, stage fills the whole dialog and inspector is hidden, then settles into the 8px/320px inset layout with the inspector fading in, reversing the same logic on close so GSAP only needs to animate the dialog's outer bounds.\n\nI should drop the now-unused overlayWidth/overlayMediaHeight/overlayPosition helpers and their tests since the destination is now just the frame rect, and make sure non-image item types (like notes) still render sensibly with their editor squeezed into the 320px inspector panel. For modeless closing, clicking outside the dialog or scrolling over the hidden grid should still work harmlessly even though the grid is now covered by the dialog.\n\nFor the inspector layout, I'm going to skip building out the \"Similar\" tab since that's out of scope for this step, and just show the Info content directly rather than adding tabs for a single item. I'll keep the close button and figure out where to place existing actions like \"find similar\" and star/move-to within the action bar instead of recreating the full tabbed mockup.\n\nI need to verify whether APIs exist for show-in-folder and delete before wiring up those actions—pin maps to onTogglePin, forget maps to archive, and trash likely maps to onDeleteArchivedItem, but I should check the actual API surface for the folder and delete actions. Move to Space will probably need a small popover listing spaces with toggle state, matching how the existing space chips render in the tag row.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1455,"cache_read_input_tokens":124861,"output_tokens":1642,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1382},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1455,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1642,"cache_read_input_tokens":124861,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1455,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1455},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":18576,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBwXCusUvwzmm2HiuZ2V","requestRef":"0ca89646-0f1c-47ba-92b0-c8d2f32038f6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a924e031-5726-4a8e-acb0-b5a6ac8b53c2","timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:51:06.891Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
