{"parentUuid":"4be1ac39-6123-4478-8649-2e3fbf211134","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01VUgZ3M1CSV1HDFf57SKNvw","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"db8e2a22-2e1c-43a7-b403-83116e8e5e75","timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:51:49.373Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"db8e2a22-2e1c-43a7-b403-83116e8e5e75","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBwZsTAx8nSLHRbNDH9W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm figuring out how to simplify the overlay's geometry handling, replacing the scroll area reference with the main-content frame rect, and considering whether to query it directly or pass it in as a frame ref prop.\n\nFor the destination placement, I'm leaning toward computing the frame rect dynamically with a ResizeObserver rather than hardcoding pixel values, so it stays accurate when the sidebar toggles and the frame resizes during the transition. For the flight animation, the dialog will expand from the card's rect to the frame rect, switching to an \"is-flying\" state that fills the stage and hides the inspector, with the image using object-fit contain during flight versus cover in the card state.\n\nI also need to strip out the old overlayMediaHeight/Width/Position logic and its test file entirely since it's no longer relevant, checking for any other code that still imports those exports. For closing, I want the stage and dialog to shrink and expand simultaneously using CSS transitions on inset and opacity/translate, with border radius animating from the sidebar radius to matching the frame's left-corner radius. I'm keeping the existing focus-mode and note-editing class structure to avoid unnecessary CSS churn, just reusing expanded-overlay-media and expanded-overlay-body as the stage and inspector containers.\n\nNow I'm planning the new inspector JSX layout: a header with a spacer and close button, title area with per-kind branches, a note box for descriptions, processing/failed states, a tags row with member chips and add button, and a details section showing saved date, source, size, and file type. I'm also deciding to keep a primary actions row for read/open PDF/find similar/edit note buttons when applicable, while letting note editing expand the inspector to fill the whole frame since the stage is hidden in that mode.\n\nFor the bottom action bar, I'm placing pin, move-to-space, and open-original/archive buttons on the left, leaving the right side empty since I'm skipping the trash and copy-link features from the mockup. I'm also planning the stage layout with a glass title pill centered at top and the media display, where images use contain-fit sizing with padding, while deferring the pixel zoom feature for later.\n\nFor non-image media types, I'm centering them in a fixed-size box within the stage rather than filling the whole area, keeping it simple for now with a dotted radial-gradient background behind. I've confirmed the existing escape-key capture listener handles search input conflicts correctly, and I'm now working out pointerdown-outside behavior to close the overlay.\n\nI need to exclude the edge tab from the \"should handle press\" check, since toggling the sidebar shouldn't close the expanded view—only clicking truly outside elements should. I'm also reconsidering the scroll-close effect, since the dialog sits as a sibling layer outside the virtualized grid's scroller, so wheel events shouldn't actually trigger a scroll-close; I need to check whether `selectionScrollRef` is still used elsewhere before removing it to avoid lint errors.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5000,"cache_read_input_tokens":133888,"output_tokens":2173,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1952},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5000,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2173,"cache_read_input_tokens":133888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5000,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_to