{"parentUuid":"78df7a31-bb29-4cfa-85bf-991fa8c6ab98","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01BuE7XBGC6NS8kzkvoVLMGS","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"246205a6-7b66-433b-a43d-f72dd53e9a2e","timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:55:17.818Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"246205a6-7b66-433b-a43d-f72dd53e9a2e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBwpTyxCgDAEFjWsyBnR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm rewriting the focus-mode overlay styling, adding back a base grid-centered layer rule for the dialog so it stays centered at full height while keeping the width constrained.\n\nStill writing styles...\n\nI'm thinking through the timing issue: removing the transition during flight means the stage snaps instantly at the start of opening, but closing should probably keep the transition so the inspector doesn't jarringly disappear. The tricky part is that the \"is-flying\" class gets applied before the first paint via a layout effect, so by the time GSAP reads the computed style, the flying styles are already active.\n\nFor the image itself, I'm reconsidering the sizing approach—using object-fit:contain means the image won't upscale beyond its intrinsic size, but applying shadow and border-radius directly to the image conflicts with how the box dimensions work when the stage padding collapses to zero during flight.\n\nI realize I can use `filter: drop-shadow()` instead of box-shadow since it traces the actual rendered pixel alpha, which works even with transparent letterboxing from contain-fit, but I should disable it during the flight animation itself to avoid repaint costs on a large image. Cover versus contain should end up looking nearly identical at card size when aspect ratios match, which simplifies that concern.\n\nNow I'm sketching out styling for non-image stage content, constraining its width and height with minimums and rounding the corners with overflow hidden.\n\nWriting flying-state overrides, title pill styling with centered positioning and ellipsis truncation, and starting the inspector panel's layout styles...\n\nStill writing inspector styles...\n\nStill styling tag chips and details rows...\n\nI'm also second-guessing the HTML structure—mixing a bare dt label without a matching dd inside a dl isn't quite valid, so I should pull the label out as a separate paragraph instead.\n\nNow I'm styling the action buttons and action bar area, setting up flexible layouts with consistent spacing, borders, and hover states for the item controls.\n\nWhen editing a note, I'm hiding the stage and expanding the inspector to fill the space with adjusted padding. For focus mode, I'm centering the overlay layer using grid placement and making the inspector full-width there too.\n\nFor narrower phone screens, I'm adding a media query that stacks the layout vertically—stage taking the top 45% and inspector filling the bottom—while making sure the flying-state override still wins due to higher selector specificity.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1120,"cache_read_input_tokens":169153,"output_tokens":3984,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":3821},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1120,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3984,"cache_read_input_tokens":169153,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1120,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1120},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":35355,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBwpTerTx8Qg6i7daJCX","requestRef":"0936695f-4405-4c73-9484-e1bf7f79a18c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e96a27e3-0ad6-4479-b11e-74313bbf657a","timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:55:17.817Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoin