{"parentUuid":"33976b91-e2d8-422b-b77a-603b839468ac","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBx1HBsEreFzcnpteXeD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Step 4 is in: opening an item now grows its card into the whole library frame, with the image on the left and an inspector on the right, like mockup 2.1. It's checked in preview, not committed yet.\n\n![item view](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\item-view.png)\n\n**What it does now:**\n- **Opening:** the card grows into the frame. Once it lands, the margins settle in and the inspector fades in from the right. Closing runs the same thing in reverse, back into the card.\n- **Image stage:** a dotted background, the whole image shown uncropped, and the title in a glass pill at the top.\n- **Inspector:**\n  - \"Close\" with an esc hint at the top. Escape closes it too.\n  - The title, then the item's description in a boxed note.\n  - The Spaces it belongs to as chips, then tags, with a round dashed button to add a tag.\n  - A Details list: Saved, From, Type, and Size when the size is known.\n  - Read, Open PDF, Find similar and Edit note show only when they apply to the item.\n- **Action bar:** star, move to Space (opens a small Space picker), open original, archive.\n- **Clicking outside** closes the view, except the sidebar edge tab, which just folds the sidebar. While you're editing a note, outside clicks are blocked so nothing you typed is lost.\n\n**Different from the mockup, or not built yet:**\n- **Show in folder and trash aren't in the action bar.** There's no show-in-folder in the app yet; it needs a small desktop-side addition. Trash would be a permanent delete outside the archive's undo. Do you want both added now, or later?\n- **No Info/Similar tabs yet.** For now Find similar is a button in the inspector.\n- **No zoom pill.** That's step 6.\n- **Other item types** (notes, PDFs, videos, quotes) still open, but they're just placed in the stage without their own treatment yet. That was already deferred.\n\n**Code changes:**\n- The overlay component was largely rewritten.\n- The old floating-card sizing helpers and their test are deleted, since nothing uses them now.\n- The CSS that only the old overlay used is removed.\n- Biome and the typecheck are clean on the changed files.\n\n**Not verified:**\n- I could see the flight starting from the card in the recording, but it only caught the first part of the open. Please click a card and close it once yourself to check the motion.\n- I didn't try a note, PDF or video, or a phone-width window. Phone width stacks the image above the inspector.\n\nShall I commit this and move on to settings?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3441,"cache_read_input_tokens":200560,"output_tokens":1017,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":159},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3441,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1017,"cache_read_input_tokens":200560,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3441,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3441},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgBx1GUwrEWh6zp8xj3PF","requestRef":"8bbfd1e7-939f-454d-b668-d1d563cd168c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fa48d92a-9643-4cd0-ac65-ac999e11ba5e","timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:57:19.930Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d2