{"parentUuid":"71670f9f-5979-4b8b-80c9-a6469d9dd93e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBxMc2kGxxr6iJhGFoT5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CbhfXpsnrc81Wky68x7Cvh","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"gh pr create --draft --base main --title \"feat(library): resurf-style glass redesign\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nThe library is moving to the dark liquid glass look from the resurf redesign mockups. This draft PR collects the pieces as they land.\n\nSo far:\n- A shared glass surface (`.glass`) for controls that float over content.\n- The library sits in a frame beside the sidebar. An edge tab flips to open and close the sidebar.\n- When idle, search is a small pill showing the current view. It grows into the full bar on focus and shrinks back on Escape.\n- Opening an item grows its card into the frame. The media sits on a dotted stage, and an inspector on the right holds the title, note, Spaces, tags, details and an action bar (star, move to Space, open original, archive). It closes only from Close or Escape.\n\nStill to come in this PR: settings, pixel zoom, back/forward. Before/after screenshots will be added once the remaining screens land.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Open draft pull request"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":415,"cache_read_input_tokens":206912,"output_tokens":557,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":96},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":415,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":557,"cache_read_input_tokens":206912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":415,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ep