{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"b3366b835bcdc78412b06581447c8bb79745ddebcce7e5c56ab00eb47860bcce","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I'm adding CSS overrides for the settings modal, styling the backdrop, modal container with library frame colors and rounded corners, and the sidebar dimensions and padding to match the mockup proportions.\n\nStill writing settings styles...\n\nI can use `:not(:last-of-type)` targeting divs, since all rows are divs and the link is a button, so it naturally excludes the final restore row from the border styling.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Markup is clean. Now the settings styles to match 3.1/3.2."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013q6JQYJE28CKJJEnLBCMTa","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\settings.css","content":"/* Settings: a dark sheet with the section list on the bare background and the\n   open section on a raised frame, matching the library frame. */\n.settings-modal-backdrop {\n  background: rgba(10, 10, 9, 0.62);\n}\n.settings-modal {\n  width: min(1080px, 100%);\n  height: min(640px, 100%);\n  border-color: var(--library-border);\n  background: var(--app-background);\n}\n.settings-modal-sidebar {\n  width: 232px;\n  min-width: 232px;\n  padding: 30px 12px 22px;\n  border-right: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n}\n.settings-sidebar-header h2 {\n  font-size: 17px;\n}\n.settings-tab {\n  min-height: 34px;\n  border-radius: var(--row-radius, 9px);\n  color: #c9c1b6;\n}\n.settings-tab.active {\n  background: var(--glass-active);\n}\n.settings-sidebar-footer {\n  margin: auto 0 0;\n  padding: 0 10px;\n  color: var(--library-muted);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n.settings-panel {\n  padding: 32px 40px;\n  border-left: 1px solid var(--library-border);\n  border-radius: var(--library-radius-overlay) 0 0 var(--library-radius-overlay);\n  background: var(--library-frame);\n}\n.settings-panel-header {\n  border-bottom: 0;\n}\n.settings-panel-header h2 {\n  font-size: 30px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n}\n.settings-panel-note {\n  max-width: 52ch;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n.settings-panel-tools {\n  display: flex;\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n.settings-close {\n  width: 32px;\n  height: 32px;\n  border-color: var(--library-border);\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: transparent;\n}\n.settings-batch-button,\n.settings-select-button {\n  height: 32px;\n  padding: 0 16px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n.settings-select-button {\n  border-color: var(--library-border);\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--library-text);\n}\n.settings-select-button:hover,\n.settings-select-button.is-active {\n  background: var(--glass-active);\n}\n.settings-data-scroll {\n  gap: 0;\n  padding-top: 28px;\n}\n.settings-makeup {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  padding: 20px 22px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--library-border);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  background: var(--library-surface);\n}\n.settings-makeup-total {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: var(--library-text);\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n}\n.settings-makeup-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 2px;\n  height: 8px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n}\n.settings-makeup-bar span {\n  flex-basis: 0;\n}\n.settings-makeup-legend {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 6px 18px;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  color: var(--library-muted);\n  font-size: 12px;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n.settings-makeup-legend li {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n.settings-makeup-legend li span {\n  width: 7px;\n  height: 7px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n}\n.settings-data-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 18px;\n  padding: 20px 0;\n}\n.settings-data-row:not(:last-of-type) {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--library-border);\n}\n.settings-data-icon {\n  display: grid;\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\n  place-items: center;\n  width: 36px;\n  height: 36px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: var(--library-surface-raised);\n  color: var(--library-text);\n}\n.settings-data-text {\n  display: flex;\n  flex: 1 1 auto;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n.settings-data-text h3 {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: var(--library-text);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n.settings-data-text p {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: var(--library-muted);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n.settings-data-button {\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\n  align-self: center;\n  padding: 0 18px;\n  border-color: var(--library-border);\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--library-text);\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n.settings-data-button.is-primary {\n  border-color: #e8e0d4;\n  background: #e8e0d4;\n  color: #141210;\n}\n.settings-data-link {\n  margin-top: 20px;\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JEeMM4Q8Pe4BivFzcP2Efa","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && python -I - \"$(pwd)/src/App.css\" \"$(cygpath -w /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/settings.css)\" <<'EOF'\nimport sys\np,c=sys.argv[1],sys.argv[2]\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read(); css=open(c,encoding='utf-8').read()\nk=s.index('/* Dark liquid glass')\ns=s[:k]+css+'\\n'+s[k:]\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='').write(s)\nEOF\nbunx biome check src/App.css 2>&1 | tail -3","description":"Insert settings CSS and lint"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
