ninkling\nEverything\n28\nTop of mind\nSerendipity\nSPACES\nDesign references\nRead later\nTop picks\nWeekend reading\nSettings\nHelp & shortcuts\nEverything\nesc to close\nAdd\n1\n2\n3\n4\n7\n8\n9\n0\n28\n items in library\nView options\nVideo\nNOTE\nBOOKS TO REREAD THIS FALL\n22 WORDS\nSettings\nLibrary\nArchive\n3\nBrowser extension\n\nEverything stays on this machine.\n\nYour library\n\nIt lives in one folder on this computer. Back it up by exporting a copy, or bring an old copy back in.\n\n28 things\n\nImages 23\nPDFs 1\nNotes & quotes 2\nVideos & posts 2\nExport a copy\n\nA dated folder with the database, every file, and a manifest. Keep it on another drive.\n\nExport runs in the desktop app.\n\nExport…\nRestore from an export\n\nAdds its items, files and Spaces here. Nothing already in your library gets replaced.\n\nRestore runs in the desktop app.\n\nRestore…\nShow the welcome again","interactiveElements":[],"consoleEntries":[{"level":"warning","text":"Invalid keyframe value for property transform: translateY(10) scale(0.98)","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:02:06.592Z"},{"level":"debug","text":"[vite] hot updated: /src/App.tsx","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:02:25.482Z"},{"level":"debug","text":"[vite] hot updated: /src/App.tsx","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:03:51.225Z"},{"level":"debug","text":"[vite] hot updated: /src/App.tsx","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:03:55.255Z"},{"level":"debug","text":"[vite] hot updated: /src/App.tsx","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:03:59.439Z"},{"level":"debug","text":"[vite] hot updated: /src/App.tsx","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:03:59.876Z"},{"level":"debug","text":"[vite] hot updated: /src/App.css","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:04:29.303Z"},{"level":"debug","text":"[vite] connecting...","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:04:32.196Z"},{"level":"debug","text":"[vite] connected.","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:04:32.209Z"},{"level":"info","text":"%cDownload the React DevTools for a better development experience: https://react.dev/link/react-devtools font-weight:bold