{"parentUuid":"880f146b-04d7-41f2-bd9c-9ae1354c95a2","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Q2epAFsELVp76AQQ7BDQmv","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"63d7bcd0-084c-47bc-86ae-b880dfabb04d","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:05:55.011Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"63d7bcd0-084c-47bc-86ae-b880dfabb04d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBxfai8YwAEBY2U79NiX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Step 5, Settings, is done. It's committed as `2d901d7` and pushed to draft PR #170. Biome and the typecheck are clean on the changed files.\n\n![Settings – Library](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\settings-library.png)\n![Settings – Archive](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\settings-archive.png)\n\n- **Tabs:** Library is now the first tab and the one settings opens on, then Archive, then Browser extension. The sidebar ends with \"Everything stays on this machine.\"\n- **Library panel:** it shows the item count with a bar and legend splitting it by type, plus an Export row and a Restore row.\n- **Archive panel:** the header has a sentence about what's in the archive, with the Select/Done button and close in the top right.\n- **Item view:** opening settings now closes any open item. Without click-outside closing, the item view would otherwise stay on top of settings.\n\nNot done yet:\n- **Archive cards:** they're still the regular library cards, not the captioned cards from the mockup. As a stopgap I made the grid narrower so more fit per row.\n- **Last two tweaks:** the screenshots were taken before the close-button size fix (it was showing at 26px instead of 32px) and the narrower archive grid. I haven't rechecked either in preview.\n- **Disk size and \"Show folder\":** I left these out because the desktop backend doesn't provide them yet.\n\nNext is step 6, pixel zoom."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":438,"cache_read_input_tokens":52555,"output_tokens":524,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_re