opic.com>\". Push to the branch. Report back briefly: what you built, any mockup parts you skipped, and the screenshot path."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":578,"cache_read_input_tokens":52993,"output_tokens":872,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":67},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":578,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":872,"cache_read_input_tokens":52993,"cache_creation_input_tokens":578,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":578},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01FicJDkzcrjZoJtV518xp8G":{"description":"Build pixel zoom step","model":"haiku","effort":"xhigh","prompt":"You are working in the git worktree C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304 (branch feat/glass-surface, draft PR https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170). Read AGENTS.md first and follow it (no pattern kills, never touch the live library, no hardcoded ports/paths, performance first, targeted Biome + tsc only).\n\nTask: step 6 of the resurf redesign, \"pixel zoom\", in the item view. The approved mockups are in Paper file 01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW, page p-6-0. Load the Paper guide (get_guide topic \"paper-mcp-instructions\"), find the pixel zoom artboard, and read its exact values with get_jsx / get_computed_styles. Implement that in the image stage of src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx (`.item-stage` / `.item-stage-image`), with CSS in src/App.css next to the existing item-view block (before `/* Dark liquid glass`). Keep it small: CSS transform-based zoom/pan on the image, no new dependencies,