{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:18:15.166Z","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a481297b12e8f1fd0</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01FicJDkzcrjZoJtV518xp8G</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tasks\\a481297b12e8f1fd0.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Build pixel zoom step\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Pixel zoom is built, verified in the existing preview, committed as `89357b4`, and pushed to `feat/glass-surface`.\n\n**What I built** (in `src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx` and `src/App.css`)\n- A `ZoomableImage` component renders the image stage. Zoom steps run from fit up to 3200% in powers of two.\n- The bottom glass pill has minus, the percentage label, and plus, matching the Paper layout. The label uses the app's `--font-ui` token instead of DM Mono.\n- Zoom and pan are transforms on the image. Drag pans while zoomed, and pan is clamped so the frame stays covered.\n- Past 800% the image renders with `image-rendering: pixelated` and a 1px white 8% grid, sized to image pixels. The grid is a screen-space overlay with the same geometry as the image.\n- While `.is-flying`, the pill and grid are hidden and pointer events are off. Nothing animates.\n- Escape and the close button are unchanged. Clicking or dragging the image never closes the view.\n\n**Decisions and skips**\n- The Paper note leaves the pixel threshold open. I picked 800%; it is one constant, `PIXEL_ZOOM`.\n- Not built: the back/forward buttons from the mockup's toolbar, which aren't zoom-related. Also no wheel or keyboard zoom, since the mockup shows only the pill.\n- The changelog is untouched. Please say if you want a line added.\n\n**Verification**\n- Biome is clean after formatting the two files. `tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json` produced no output.\n- In the preview on `localhost:5173` (the existing server, reused), with demo data: zooming in five steps reached 1600% with the grid and pixelated rendering. A drag panned the image and grid together. Zooming back out to fit cleared the transform and grid, and Escape closed the view.\n\nScreenshot: `C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\pixel-zoom.png`</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>209365</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>53</tool_uses><duration_ms>529188</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
