{"parentUuid":"2406161c-da75-46ce-a6ea-d8b8ee7cd5c5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBycgdrTja1QsEUeQEwo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Step 6, pixel zoom, is done by Haiku and pushed to PR #170 as `89357b4`. It reports Biome and the typecheck clean, and says it tested the zoom in the preview with demo data.\n\n![Pixel zoom](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\pixel-zoom.png)\n\n- **Zoom control:** a glass pill at the bottom of the image with minus, the current percentage, and plus. It steps from fit up to 3200%, doubling each step.\n- **Panning:** once zoomed in, you can drag the image around, and it stops at the image's edges.\n- **Pixel view:** past 800% the image shows sharp pixels with a faint pixel grid over it. The mockup left that cut-off open, so Haiku picked 800%; it's one constant if you want another value.\n- **Closing:** still only the close button or Esc. Clicking or dragging the image doesn't close it.\n- **Not included:** mouse-wheel and keyboard zoom, since the mockup shows only the pill.\n- **Changelog:** no entry has been added yet.\n\nThe last step is back/forward history. Want Haiku to do that one too?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1316,"cache_read_input_tokens":54869,"output_tokens":400,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1316,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":400,"cache_read_input_tokens":54869,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1316,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1316},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"ty