ation: Fail.** Repro: open “Where the waves land,” close it, scroll to the top so its card is off-screen and absent from the rendered cards, then click Back. The item opens at full frame without `.is-flying`. Alt+Right closes it without `.is-flying` as well.\\n- **Esc, close button, and zoom: Pass.** Esc and Close dismissed the item. Zoom changed from 33% to 100%, then returned to 33%.\\n- **Forward history truncation: Pass.** From the middle of history, entering a new query disabled Forward.\\n- **Console errors: Pass.** No console errors or exceptions observed.\\n\\nScreenshots saved under `C:\\\\Users\\\\chris\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\agents\\\\chat-images\\\\resurf-redesign\\\\`:\\n\\n![Search history state](C:\\\\Users\\\\chris\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\agents\\\\chat-images\\\\resurf-redesign\\\\history-search.png)\\n\\n![Item at full frame](C:\\\\Users\\\\chris\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\agents\\\\chat-images\\\\resurf-redesign\\\\history-item-full.png)\\n\\n![Off-screen item reopened without flight](C:\\\\Users\\\\chris\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\agents\\\\chat-images\\\\resurf-redesign\\\\history-offscreen-open.png)\\n\\nOther saved files: `history-start.png` and `history-item-open.png`.\",\"latestTerminalResultContextTransferId\":\"context-transfer:type:subagent_result:source-thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A2145c272-83fd-42d3-8388-cb51df16dc9f%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-test-r1:target-thread:d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f:561aecf2-7e36-4891-9850-5eb6eb48afa1\",\"providerInstanceId\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"summary\":\"**Preview end-to-end results** — no source changes made.\\n\\n- **History buttons and state restoration: Pass.** Both buttons were disabled at the initial boundary. Back and forward restored search, the Design references Space, the Everything/Top of mind view, and the open Batman item.\\n- **Burst search typing: Pass.** Entered `shark` in one burst; one Back returned to an empty qu