{"parentUuid":"b137f4d6-92d2-4938-9a2d-0eedc371e5fc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC3teodNhVdbnwrbdkQE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The end-to-end test failed on one check: an item whose card is scrolled out of view still opens and closes through back/forward without the card animation. The first fix only works when the card is on screen. I've sent it back to a GPT-6 Luna on high: history will jump the grid to the card first, then fly from it and back to it.\n\nEverything else passed in the preview:\n- The back/forward buttons grey out at both ends. Stepping through history restores the search, the Space, the view and the open item.\n- A burst of typing in search counts as one step back.\n- Alt+Left/Right work. The tool can't press the mouse side buttons, so Luna sent those clicks in code instead, and they worked.\n- Items on screen fly from their card and back.\n- Starting a new search from the middle of the history greys out Forward.\n- Esc, the close button and pixel zoom still work.\n- There were no console errors.\n\n![Off-screen item reopened without flight](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\history-offscreen-open.png)\n\nI'll report back when the fix is in. Still open: should back/forward also land on the \"Find similar\" results screen?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1303,"cache_read_input_tokens":68474,"output_tokens":381,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1303,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":381,"cache_read_input_tokens":68474,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1303,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_token