{"parentUuid":"32250928-70fb-4130-9b37-9b3a40276b52","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgC5KfSPfX7iaQrQjHqhK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"Find similar\" results are now their own stop in back/forward, pushed as `0e169c3`. Going back to them also brings back the item you started from. The lint and typecheck on `src/App.tsx` passed.\n\nI haven't seen it work yet, though. \"Find similar\" only appears in the desktop app, not the web preview, so Luna could only check that Back and Forward still close and reopen items there.\n\nTo check it yourself in the desktop app (`bun run build:dir`):\n1. Open an item and click \"Find similar\".\n2. Open one of the results.\n3. Press Back: you should land on the similar results.\n4. Press Back again: you should be where you were before.\n5. Press Forward: the similar results should come back.\n\nAll seven redesign steps and the history fixes are now on draft PR #170. Do you want a changelog line for the redesign?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1624,"cache_read_input_tokens":74103,"output_tokens":268,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1624,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":268,"cache_read_input_tokens":74103,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1624,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1624},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgC5Kf9YNJKVWKXnU5tW4","requestRef":"c0357758-2712-47b1-a624-49024ad21e85","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"t3-cod