{"parentUuid":"2ed3ea32-62c0-4951-a994-e02d787ea4e7","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_delta","addedNames":[],"addedLines":[],"removedNames":["mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__add_asset_to_bookmarks","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__add_asset_to_collection","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__create_collection","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__create_collection_from_bookmarks","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__delete_asset_from_bookmarks","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__delete_asset_from_collection","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__delete_bookmarks","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__delete_collection","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__download_asset","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_assets_from_collection","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_bookmarks","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_collection","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_current_user","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_featured_collections","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_related_collections","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_user_collections","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_by_image","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_collections","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_illustrations","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_photos","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_related","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_users","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__update_collection","mcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__upload_image_for_search"],"wireHiddenNames":[],"readdedNames":[],"pendingMcpServers":["claude.ai Unsplash","onesamosa"],"needsAuthMcpServers":[],"failedMcpServers":[]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"01ee374c-3f0e-40d5-a2d7-6ca30e3fa03f","timestamp":"2026-10-19T19:57:15.132Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe following deferred tools are no longer available (their MCP server disconnected). Do not search for them — ToolSearch will return no match:\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__add_asset_to_bookmarks\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__add_asset_to_collection\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__create_collection\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__create_collection_from_bookmarks\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__delete_asset_from_bookmarks\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__delete_asset_from_collection\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__delete_bookmarks\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__delete_collection\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__download_asset\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_assets_from_collection\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_bookmarks\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_collection\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_current_user\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_featured_collections\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_related_collections\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__get_user_collections\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_by_image\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_collections\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_illustrations\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_photos\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_related\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__search_users\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__update_collection\nmcp__claude_ai_Unsplash__upload_image_for_search\n\nThis is ambient context — do not narrate it to the user unless they ask or it is directly relevant to their request.\n\nThe following MCP servers are still connecting — their tools (typically named mcp__<server>__*) are not yet available but will appear shortly:\nclaude.ai Unsplash\nonesamosa\n\nIf the user's request might be served by one of these servers (even if they didn't name it explicitly), call ToolSearch with a relevant keyword — ToolSearch will wait for connecting servers and search their tools once available. Do not report a capability as unavailable without first searching.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
