{"parentUuid":"ec98a48a-ef60-48d3-a177-a4c71b8ce032","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgCBnJVmCKKcddvEWsTtp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should keep one concern per PR, so I'll flag this on the redesign PR specifically rather than mixing it in elsewhere.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":305,"cache_read_input_tokens":85987,"output_tokens":347,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":26},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":305,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":347,"cache_read_input_tokens":85987,"cache_creation_input_tokens":305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":305},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":2865,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgCBnJCuvKHNf8TMkfLKE","requestRef":"fbe3c0a4-aa4a-46e5-a8c7-4ac0539e73ad","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b7e72a26-c13b-479c-8e16-66e40231c988","timestamp":"2026-10-19T19:57:52.321Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.303","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"b7e72a26-c13b-479c-8e16-66e40231c988","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgCBnJVmCKKcddvEWsTtp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I updated `t3.json` and pushed it as `e4eaf75`. The entries it already had all still pointed at working commands, but it was missing eight useful `package.json` scripts, so I added them:\n\n- **Build desktop app (unpacked):** `build:dir`\n- **Build Windows installer:** `build:installer`\n- **Typecheck:** `typecheck`\n- **Run tests:** `test`\n- **Find unused code:** `knip`\n- **Ingestion smoke:** `ingest:smoke`\n- **PDF smoke:** `test:pdf`\n- **Run benchmarks:** `bench`\n\nThe repo's command check (`bun run check:refs`) passed. I couldn't load T3's schema to see which icons it allows, so the two build entries use the existing \"configure\" icon. A \"build\" icon may exist and would fit better.\n\nI committed this to the redesign branch (PR #170). It has nothing to do with the redesign, so I can move it to its own PR if you want."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":305,"cache_read_input_tokens":85987,"output_tokens":347,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":26},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":305,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":347,"cache_read_input_tokens":85987,"cache_creation_input_tokens":305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":305},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgCBnJCuvKHNf8TMkfLKE","requestRef":"fbe3c0a4-aa4a-46e5-a8c7-4ac0539e73ad","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant"