{"parentUuid":"2ba2d751-099f-444b-ba8d-9ca8c9070107","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgCTB3wJNXwuHPU46v2dT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here are the candidates, in the order I'd do them.\n\n**Finish this PR (#170) first:**\n1. **Test \"Find similar\" in the desktop app.** It's the one piece nobody has seen working, because it doesn't exist in the web preview.\n2. **Add a changelog line** for the redesign. You haven't answered whether you want one yet.\n3. **Add before/after screenshots to the PR description.** The repo rules ask for them on UI changes. Then mark the PR ready for review.\n\n**Then the parts of the redesign we put off:**\n4. **Item views for the other kinds.** Only photos have the new full-frame view; articles, PDFs, video, posts, notes, quotes and files still need theirs. This is the biggest piece, and I'd do it one kind at a time.\n5. **Processing and failed states** in the new item view, for while background work runs and when it fails.\n6. **The archived item view.**\n7. **The Similar tab.**\n\nI'd do 1–3 now, since they're small and close out the PR, then start 4 with articles. They're probably the most-saved kind after images. Want me to set Haiku or Luna on 2 and 3?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":72156,"cache_read_input_tokens":15387,"output_tokens":418,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":43},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":72156,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":418,"cache_read_input_tokens":15387,"cache_creation_input_tokens":72156,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":72156},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},