opened image item, and Settings. Save them to C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\pr-before-*.png / pr-after-*.png.\n3. Upload them to GitHub so they render in the PR body. One approach: create a GitHub release-free gist, or use `gh api` to upload as issue-comment attachments. If you can't get images hosted on GitHub without committing them to the repo, stop and report that.\n4. Update the PR body with `gh pr edit 170 --body-file`. Keep the existing text and add a \"Before / After\" section with a small table per screen. The body should end with \"🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\".\n5. Stop both dev servers by the PIDs you captured, then remove the temp worktree (`git worktree remove`).\nReport what you did, and the screenshot paths."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
