{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":170,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:28:22.432Z"}
{"parentUuid":"4624c457-6813-4025-a4c2-4555a90cf136","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgCTqfAftjvpUdPvj8KV3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've started three Haiku agents to compare the app against the Paper redesign. They're only reading and listing differences, not changing anything. Each one covers a different part:\n\n1. **Main window:** the sidebar, header, search, the grid, every card type, the list view, empty states and the Add flow.\n2. **Opened item view:** every item type, the processing and failed states, the archived view and the Similar tab.\n3. **Everything else:** Settings, Archive, Help, onboarding, dialogs, Top of mind and Serendipity. This one also lists every screen on the Paper page, so nothing gets skipped.\n\nI'll combine their findings into one list of what isn't done, grouped by screen.\n\nThe Luna test of \"Find similar\" and the Haiku before/after screenshots for the PR are still running too."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3709,"cache_read_input_tokens":96437,"output_tokens":257,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3709,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":257,"cache_read_input_tokens":96437,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3709,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3709},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgCTqenqwychxcBvP8kDc","requestRef":"30998b20-870c-4646-bbbb-969c1b30182c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"017d94c2-f404-42cb-9588-e53c037c85