{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:35:52.650Z","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a7fb4ede9cd2de13a</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_015FZge6C6gNEkHFQLGoiGVh</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tasks\\a7fb4ede9cd2de13a.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Audit settings/other vs Paper\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>**Scope:** Read-only audit of Paper page p-6-0 against the code. No files were edited and no servers were touched. The running app was not checked; the only runtime evidence is the user's screenshot. Abbreviations: `App.tsx` is `C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\src\\App.tsx`, `App.css` is the same folder's `src\\App.css`, and mascot code is under `src\\components\\mascot\\`.\n\n## (1) Artboards on p-6-0 (15)\n\n| Artboard | Area | Audited |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1.1 Library | Grid | No (out of scope) |\n| 1.2 Search · drops in | Search | No |\n| 1.3 Search · query pinned | Search | No |\n| 2.1 Item · Resurf-style inspector | Item | No |\n| 2.2 Item · Similar tab | Item | No |\n| 2.3 Item · zoomed in, pixel grid | Item | No |\n| 3.1 Settings · Library | Settings | Yes |\n| 3.2 Settings · Archive | Archive | Yes |\n| 4.1 Mascot · search bar travel + states | Mascot | Yes |\n| Note · Liquid glass experiment | Note | Yes |\n| Note · Pixel zoom | Note (item view) | No |\n| §1 Library &amp; search | Label | n/a |\n| §2 Item view | Label | n/a |\n| §3 Settings | Label | n/a |\n| §4 Mascot | Label | n/a |\n\n## (2) Not done or not matching\n\n**Settings · Library (3.1)**\n- Scrim › Paper `#080807` at 74%; app `rgba(10,10,9,.62)` (App.css:5385) › wrong (minor)\n- Panel padding and radius › Paper 28/40/32/48 with a 16px left radius; app 32/40 with a 24px radius (App.css:5418–5423) › wrong (minor)\n- Panel title and note › Paper DM Sans 28/34 at -0.02em, note 14/21 at 460px; app 30px Paper Mono, note 13px at 52ch (App.css:5427–5434) › wrong (minor)\n- Rail title \"Settings\" › Paper DM Sans 15px; app 17px (App.css:5400) › wrong (minor)\n- Rail active row › Paper has no fill and weight 500; app has an 8% white pill and weight 600 (App.css:5408–5409). Visible in the user's screenshot › wrong (minor)\n- Rail footer › Paper adds \"inkling 0.1.0\" (DM Mono 11px). App has no version line, and the renderer has no version source (the version exists only in the export manifest, `electron\\storage.mjs:1947`) › missing (minor)\n- Count line › Paper adds \"2.4 GB on disk\" (DM Mono 12px). `LibraryMakeup` (App.tsx:1497) takes no size input and no size data exists › missing\n- \"Show folder\" pill › Paper has a 28px pill beside the count. App has no control and no reveal-folder call anywhere in the repo › missing\n- Export row › Paper shows a persistent \"last copy Oct 12 · 1,588 items\" line. App keeps `lastExport` in component state only (App.tsx:1627), so it is lost on restart › missing\n- Legend › Paper text `#A8A096` and Files swatch `#4A443E`; app legend inherits muted `#8D867C` and Files `#5E5850` (App.tsx:1494, App.css:5502) › wrong (minor)\n- Close button › Paper 34×34, app 32×32 (App.css:5443) › wrong (minor)\n- Focus › App focuses the close button on open (App.tsx:3556). That causes the orange ring in the user's screenshot. Paper has no focus state › wrong (minor)\n- \"Show the welcome again\" link › app only, not on Paper (App.tsx:5799) › minor (undesigned)\n\n**Browser extension tab**\n- No artboard. The rail row exists in Paper, but the §3 label scopes the sheet to library, backups, and archive › missing (design)\n- ExtensionPairing (App.tsx:1283–1446) uses inline styles and shows \"Listening on 127.0.0.1:port\". Renew calls native `window.confirm` (App.tsx:1336) › wrong (minor)\n\n**Archive (3.2)**\n- Tile geometry › Paper: uniform 179×174 tiles, 132px media, 10px radius, no border, 14px column gap and 22px row gap. App reuses the library card: 4:5 aspect (App.css:1618), 20px radius with border, variable height, and a 14px row gap (App.css:2987–2991) › wrong\n- Tile captions › Paper has a title and a \"Kind · time\" line under every tile. App's `.library-card .card-content { display: none }` (App.css:1641) is not overridden in the archive, so only artwork shows. Images, PDFs, and articles have no visible title or kind › missing\n- Hover actions › Paper has a Restore pill and a 28px round delete at bottom right, with a 2px outline on the media. App has a 30px delete only, top right (App.css:2997), and no Restore on the card › missing\n- Selection mode › no artboard on p-6-0. A multi-select artboard exists on p-3-0 (not audited). App has \"N selected\", Recover, Delete, and circle icons (App.tsx:5627–5653, 1016–1052). Paper says \"Restore\" where the app says \"Recover\" › missing (design); label wrong (minor)\n- Empty archive › no artboard. App has a dashed empty state (App.tsx:5692–5699) › missing (design)\n- Header buttons › Paper Select is 34px and close is 34×34; app is 32px (App.css:5443, 5451) › minor\n\n**Mascot (4.1)**\n- Expressions › Paper names listening, reading, notify, sad, confused, return. App has neutre, attentif, surpris, triste, confus, curieux (mascot\\bot\\expressions.ts) and a notification state (mascot\\bot\\states.ts). Names match; visuals not checked\n- Sidebar-to-search travel › Paper specifies 0.38s with frames at 120, 240, and 380ms, plus a 0.18s delayed reverse. App's roam engine uses 700–2,400ms moves and 700–1,200ms home trips (mascot\\roam.ts:101–105) and has no 0.38s or 0.18s constants › wrong (unverified in running app)\n\n**Top of mind and Serendipity**\n- Top of mind count › Paper shows \"11\". App shows no count (App.tsx:4641–4652) › missing (minor)\n- Icons › Paper uses a star and a shuffle. App uses Sparkles (App.tsx:4650) and Clock01 (App.tsx:4658) › wrong (minor)\n- Serendipity view › no artboard on p-6-0. App has a full view with intro, \"N older items left\", keep/forget/details, and a completion state (App.tsx:5373+, App.css:1990–2183) › missing (design)\n- Top of mind view › no artboard. App renders the pins view (App.tsx:3870) › missing (design)\n\n**Help, onboarding, toasts, dialogs, menus**\n- Help &amp; shortcuts › no artboard. App has a \"Keyboard shortcuts\" dialog (App.tsx:5223–5293) and a sidebar footer entry (App.tsx:4894–4905). Paper's sidebar footer has only Settings and the avatar › missing (design)\n- Onboarding / welcome › no artboard on p-6-0. App has FirstRunOverlay (App.tsx:5220; `components\\FirstRunOverlay.tsx`, `components\\onboarding\\`) › missing (design)\n- Toasts › no artboard on p-6-0. App uses sonner with `.library-toast` styling (App.css:3326) › missing (design)\n- Confirmations › only the native `window.confirm` at App.tsx:1336. Archive delete uses an undo window instead (App.tsx ~1229) › wrong (minor)\n- Menus › no artboard, and no menu UI found in App.tsx › n/a\n\n**Notes**\n- Liquid glass note › recommends liquid-dom (WebGPU) for floating chrome. Neither `package.json` nor `src` has WebGPU or liquid-dom; only CSS backdrop-filter glass exists (App.css:32–34) › missing (the note's primary path)\n\n**Systemic**\n- Typography › the app's UI font is Paper Mono for all text (App.css:6–7, 35–36). Paper uses DM Sans for headings and labels, system-ui for body, DM Mono for meta, and Libre Baskerville for quotes. Every Settings and Archive text style differs › wrong (systemic). This may be intentional; it needs a maintainer decision.\n\n## Artboards with no implementation\n\n- None of the 15 artboards in my area is missing a screen. The liquid-glass WebGPU path is missing, and the mascot travel timings do not match.\n- Designs in code with no artboard on p-6-0: Help &amp; shortcuts, onboarding, toasts, Serendipity view, Top of mind view, Browser extension panel, archive selection mode, archive empty state, and \"Show the welcome again\".\n- Menus: no artboard and no implementation.\n\n## Cross-page\n\np-3-0 (\"screens\") holds Onboarding 1–4, \"Inkling toast components · current\", \"Settings overlay - Archive - Multi-select\", and an archive overlay labelled BROKEN. I did not audit these because the scope was p-6-0. I can audit them next if you want.\n\n## Matches\n\nSettings sheet geometry (1080×640, centered, 24px radius, shadow), rail labels and icons, the archive count in the rail, the Library and Archive panel copy, and type-bar proportions.\n\n## Not checked\n\nThe running app, the shell, search, and item artboards, and mascot motion.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>234013</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>75</tool_uses><duration_ms>450579</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
