travel timings do not match.\n- Designs in code with no artboard on p-6-0: Help &amp; shortcuts, onboarding, toasts, Serendipity view, Top of mind view, Browser extension panel, archive selection mode, archive empty state, and \"Show the welcome again\".\n- Menus: no artboard and no implementation.\n\n## Cross-page\n\np-3-0 (\"screens\") holds Onboarding 1–4, \"Inkling toast components · current\", \"Settings overlay - Archive - Multi-select\", and an archive overlay labelled BROKEN. I did not audit these because the scope was p-6-0. I can audit them next if you want.\n\n## Matches\n\nSettings sheet geometry (1080×640, centered, 24px radius, shadow), rail labels and icons, the archive count in the rail, the Library and Archive panel copy, and type-bar proportions.\n\n## Not checked\n\nThe running app, the shell, search, and item artboards, and mascot motion.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>234013</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>75</tool_uses><duration_ms>450579</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"293bd943-c937-4053-be20-a1aa6c116c11","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:35:52.716Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification","producer":"session-task","runId":"0mvfvxu7l-a8f68b36"},"promptSource":"system","turnOrigin":"task_notification","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":0,"turnIndex":88},"queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
