 Sidebar › Spaces heading › Paper: sentence case 12px/500, 0.02em; app: uppercase 10px mono (App.css:282-291) › minor\n- Sidebar › Space counts › Paper: every row shows its count (492, 38, 27, 64, 19, 12); app: count only on the active Space, blank otherwise (App.tsx:4724-4726) › wrong\n- Sidebar › Space markers › Paper: six distinct blobs (#B0714F, #7F9A8C, #C98B8B, #C9B27A, #8E9BBF, #A88AB5); app: 8px circles, only \"orange\" has a color, blue/green/pink/purple render grey (App.css:371-391), so the color-cycle click looks like a no-op for four of five colors › wrong\n- Sidebar › footer › Paper: Settings (13px) plus 28px avatar; app: Settings (12px), a Help &amp; shortcuts row (app-only), conditional update row, no avatar › missing (avatar). An avatar implies an account, which AGENTS.md rules out, so this needs a maintainer call before adding it.\n- Window › Paper has no OS chrome; app shows Windows caption buttons (ElectronWindowControls) › no artboard\n\n**Header, toolbar, search pill, Add**\n- Toolbar › back/forward and grid/list toggles › Paper: both in glass capsules at top-left; app: bare back/forward grouped with the center pill (App.tsx:4927-4948), view toggles moved to a solid bordered box on a separate row below (App.tsx:5331-5369, App.css:3459-3485) › wrong (major)\n- Toolbar › glass over grid › Paper: toolbar floats over cards (masonry marginTop -96px); app: toolbar is a separate row, cards never scroll under it › wrong\n- Toolbar › resting search pill › Paper: 117x34, radius 17, 13px/600 label; app: 40px tall, radius 20 (App.css:5046-5052) › minor\n- Add button › Paper: 34px pill, radius 999, padding 11/14, 14px icon, 13px/600 system-ui; app: 50px tall, radius 20, 18px icon, Paper Mono (App.css:870-887, 1296-1324; App.tsx:4987) › wrong\n- Item count › Paper: no count line in browse; \"N results\" right-aligned DM Mono 12px in search; app: \"N items in library\" always at left (App.tsx:5307-5313) › wrong\n- Collapse button › Paper: 26x34 chevron on sidebar edge; app: 30px in brand row (App.tsx:4619-4626) › minor\n\n**Search states**\n- 1.3 query pinned › Paper: pill stays centered, query becomes a glass chip (138x30, radius 999, 13px/500, close ×) with \"6 results\" at right; app: bar stays expanded while a query exists (App.tsx:4950), no chip, count line reads `for \"query\"` plus a Save as Space link (App.tsx:5314-5327) › wrong (major)\n- 1.2 drop-in › Paper: 700x50 glass bar overlays the toolbar with deeper shadow (0 18px 40px); app: expands in place via width transition (App.css:5035-5052) with generic .glass shadow (App.css:5655-5658) › minor\n\n**Grid and cards**\n- Grid density › Paper: 4 columns of 286px, 12px gap, 14px inset; app: 170px target, 8px gap, 48px side padding (App.tsx:1213-1219, App.css:610), giving 6 columns of about 176px at 1440 wide › wrong (major). Paper's card type sizes are drawn for 286px, so they shrink too.\n- Image card › Paper: no border; app: 1px border on every card (App.css:1598) › minor\n- Article card › Paper: cream #ECE6DC card, 120px image, 16px/600 title #1A1714, \"aeon.co · 12 min\" DM Mono 11px #7A7268; app: dark surface card, and in grid `.library-card .card-content {display:none}` (App.css:1641) hides title and domain, so the article reads as an untitled image › wrong (major)\n- File card › no Paper artboard; app: kind File (and Post without data) falls into an empty artwork branch with no grid text, so it renders a blank tile when there is no thumbnail (App.tsx:1079-1107) › missing (major, breaks \"visual by type\")\n- Quote card › Paper: 110px Georgia mark #C4BA8C, full quote in DM Sans 18px/128% #D0C68F, 120px divider, DM Mono 10px attribution; app: 56px mark in grid, Paper Mono 16px clamped to 2 lines, text cut at 69 chars (App.tsx:936-939), 9px attribution (App.css:1844-1855, 2362-2404) › wrong\n- Note and PDF cards › Paper: DM Sans 21px/600 uppercase title, 10px DM Mono label, 22px ring, 10px dots; app: same artwork structure (ItemMedia.tsx:85-135) but 17px Paper Mono title, 9px label, 20px ring, 9px dots (App.css:2295-2329) › wrong (minor-moderate)\n- Video card › Paper: 190px tall, bottom-left glass pill with play glyph and \"14:08\" (DM Mono 11px), no center button; app: 42px center play disc (App.css:3852-3871), pill shows provider name, no duration (App.tsx:919-922). The item model has no duration field, so Paper's duration needs a data change › wrong (moderate)\n- Liquid glass note › app has only the CSS backdrop-filter fallback; no WebGPU/HTML-in-canvas path exists in the repo › missing (experiment; fallback in place)\n\n**Artboards or states with no Paper design in p-6-0 (cannot be compared)**\n- List view (App.css:1951+)\n- Card hover and selected states (App.css:1610-1617, 2526)\n- Empty states: grid, regular Space, similar, pinned (App.tsx:5487-5532)\n- Add/capture menu and its options, including Screenshot (App.tsx:4994-5218)\n- Space create (Smart/Regular), rename, move, delete, hover-only actions (App.tsx:4697-4853, App.css:396-408)\n- Serendipity view (App.tsx:5373-5472)\n- Help &amp; shortcuts modal, update row, collapsed sidebar edge tab\n- Post card type\n\n**Tokens:** Paper's `--library-text-soft`, `--nav-label-active`, `--row-radius` and `--card-radius` are not defined in App.css `:root`. `.item-zoom-label` uses an undefined `var(--library-text-soft)` (App.css:5633), so it falls back to inherited color. That rule is in the item view, not my area.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>219461</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>77</tool_uses><duration_ms>556524</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
