so it renders a blank tile when there is no thumbnail (App.tsx:1079-1107) › missing (major, breaks \"visual by type\")\n- Quote card › Paper: 110px Georgia mark #C4BA8C, full quote in DM Sans 18px/128% #D0C68F, 120px divider, DM Mono 10px attribution; app: 56px mark in grid, Paper Mono 16px clamped to 2 lines, text cut at 69 chars (App.tsx:936-939), 9px attribution (App.css:1844-1855, 2362-2404) › wrong\n- Note and PDF cards › Paper: DM Sans 21px/600 uppercase title, 10px DM Mono label, 22px ring, 10px dots; app: same artwork structure (ItemMedia.tsx:85-135) but 17px Paper Mono title, 9px label, 20px ring, 9px dots (App.css:2295-2329) › wrong (minor-moderate)\n- Video card › Paper: 190px tall, bottom-left glass pill with play glyph and \"14:08\" (DM Mono 11px), no center button; app: 42px center play disc (App.css:3852-3871), pill shows provider name, no duration (App.tsx:919-922). The item model has no duration field, so Paper's duration needs a data change › wrong (moderate)\n- Liquid glass note › app has only the CSS backdrop-filter fallback; no WebGPU/HTML-in-canvas path exists in the repo › missing (experiment; fallback in place)\n\n**Artboards or states with no Paper design in p-6-0 (cannot be compared)**\n- List view (App.css:1951+)\n- Card hover and selected states (App.css:1610-1617, 2526)\n- Empty states: grid, regular Space, similar, pinned (App.tsx:5487-5532)\n- Add/capture menu and its options, including Screenshot (App.tsx:4994-5218)\n- Space create (Smart/Regular), rename, move, delete, hover-only actions (App.tsx:4697-4853, App.css:396-408)\n- Serendipity view (App.tsx:5373-5472)\n- Help &amp; shortcuts modal, update row, collapsed sidebar edge tab\n- Post card type\n\n**Tokens:** Paper's `--library-text-soft`, `--nav-label-active`, `--row-radius` and `--card-radius` are not defined in App.css `:root`. `.item-zoom-label` uses an undefined `var(--library-text-soft)` (App.css:5633), so it falls back to inherited color. That rule is in the item view, not my area.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>219461</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>77</tool_uses><duration_ms>556524</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>\n</system-reminder>"}]}}
