{"parentUuid":"61076045-b7cd-4ada-b7b7-96ce26685ff8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c93931d9-8c71-424b-9259-982c4dddbb3c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0127wnZ3zeSHfr7yCzh1MxMh","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"taskId\":\"node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Asimilar-history-desktop-test-r1\",\"childThreadId\":\"thread:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Asimilar-history-desktop-test-r1\",\"childRunId\":\"run:thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Asimilar-history-desktop-test-r1:ordinal:1\",\"childNodeId\":\"node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Asimilar-history-desktop-test-r1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"workState\":\"result_available\",\"hasPendingChildRuns\":false,\"latestTerminalRunId\":\"run:thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Asimilar-history-desktop-test-r1:ordinal:1\",\"latestTerminalStatus\":\"completed\",\"latestTerminalSummary\":\"## Result: partial fail\\n\\n**The Forward-to-similar-results step failed.** After two Backs returned to “Spider-Man in the rain,” the Forward button was disabled, and the similar-results context was gone.\\n\\n| Step | Result |\\n|---|---|\\n| Isolate the library | **Pass.** Electron’s `--user-data-dir` switch sets the app’s `userData` directory. I seeded a fresh temp library from the committed demo seed and left the live library untouched. |\\n| Run with the full backend | **Pass via the dev path.** `bun run build:dir` hit an `EPERM` rename because the existing output was locked while the desktop app was running. I used a separate build output and then the production renderer in Electron with the real backend. |\\n| Open an item → Find similar → open a result | **Pass.** Find similar returned the related seeded image. The needed image embeddings had completed. |\\n| Back to similar results | **Pass.** The result closed and the similar-results view returned. |\\n| Back to the prior item | **Pass.** The source item reopened. |\\n| Forward to similar results | **Fail.** Forward was disabled at the source item. |\\n\\n**Repro:** In the sandbox app, open “Spider-Man in the rain,” choose **Find similar**, open “Eye lenses,” then press Back twice. Forward is disabled, and the similar-results view does not return.\\n\\nThe card flight animation was visible on item open and on the Back transition that returned to results. For these transitions, the overlay intercepted pointer hit-testing on the Back control, so I activated the rendered button through its click handler; the history behavior was exercised, but pointer clicking that control was not verified.\\n\\nScreenshots are in `C:\\\\Users\\\\chris\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\agents\\\\chat-images\\\\resurf-redesign\\\\`:\\n\\n- Similar results: [similar-history-similar-results.png](C:\\\\Users\\\\chris\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\agents\\\\chat-images\\\\resurf-redesign\\\\similar-history-similar-results.png)\\n- Opening a result flight: [similar-history-result-open-flight.png](C:\\\\Users\\\\chris\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\agents\\\\chat-images\\\\resurf-redesign\\\\similar-history-result-open-flight.png)\\n- Back to results flight: [similar-history-back-results-close-flight.png](C:\\\\Users\\\\chris\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\agents\\\\chat-images\\\\resurf-redesign\\\\similar-history-back-results-close-flight.png)\\n- Back to source flight: [similar-history-back-source-open-flight.png](C:\\\\Users\\\\chris\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\agents\\\\chat-images\\\\resurf-redesign\\\\similar-history-back-source-open-flight.png)\\n\\nI closed only the sandbox Electron process I had captured at launch (PID 31684). No source files were changed.\",\"latestTerminalResultContextTransferId\":\"c