rd is disabled, and the similar-results view does not return.\n\nThe card flight animation was visible on item open and on the Back transition that returned to results. For these transitions, the overlay intercepted pointer hit-testing on the Back control, so I activated the rendered button through its click handler; the history behavior was exercised, but pointer clicking that control was not verified.\n\nScreenshots are in `C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\`:\n\n- Similar results: [similar-history-similar-results.png](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\similar-history-similar-results.png)\n- Opening a result flight: [similar-history-result-open-flight.png](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\similar-history-result-open-flight.png)\n- Back to results flight: [similar-history-back-results-close-flight.png](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\similar-history-back-results-close-flight.png)\n- Back to source flight: [similar-history-back-source-open-flight.png](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\similar-history-back-source-open-flight.png)\n\nI closed only the sandbox Electron process I had captured at launch (PID 31684). No source files were changed.","resultContextTransferId":"context-transfer:type:subagent_result:source-thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Asimilar-history-desktop-test-r1:target-thread:d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f:d6ec58cf-7539-4568-bff4-1933f16b18dc","hasPendingQuestion":false,"waitTimedOut":false}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"61076045-b7cd-4ada-b7b7-96ce26685ff8","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionI