{"parentUuid":"92b42bc6-049b-45e2-beeb-f3bef3ba22cd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"199ae338-763c-45f4-b070-9ba0b9855075","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K9RDT1mGJEf6NYyKwvfja1","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"taskId\":\"node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Ahistory-fix-r4-forward\",\"childThreadId\":\"thread:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Ahistory-fix-r4-forward\",\"childRunId\":\"run:thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:ordinal:1\",\"childNodeId\":\"node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Ahistory-fix-r4-forward\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"workState\":\"result_available\",\"hasPendingChildRuns\":false,\"latestTerminalRunId\":\"run:thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:ordinal:1\",\"latestTerminalStatus\":\"completed\",\"latestTerminalSummary\":\"Cause: when Back closed the open item, the history effect saw the intermediate similar-mode state as new navigation and replaced the forward entries. A delayed search commit could also write a stale snapshot after navigation.\\n\\nThe fix marks the target snapshot before restoring state, ignores intermediate restore states, and discards delayed commits when history has moved. Find similar needs the desktop backend, so I traced that restore path in code instead of running it in preview.\\n\\nPreview Back×4 and Forward×4 round-tripped through a view change, a Space, a Spider-Man search, and the opened item. Biome and TypeScript checks passed. I didn’t add a Bun test because this behavior depends on React effects and overlay state.\\n\\nCommitted and pushed as `bc69b0479f280ec843f1d95b862bc5d3de543195`. The worktree is clean.\",\"latestTerminalResultContextTransferId\":\"context-transfer:type:subagent_result:source-thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:target-thread:d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f:f48d9f11-c3dd-4fc7-a06c-b04b5ec2a932\",\"providerInstanceId\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"summary\":\"Cause: when Back closed the open item, the history effect saw the intermediate similar-mode state as new navigation and replaced the forward entries. A delayed search commit could also write a stale snapshot after navigation.\\n\\nThe fix marks the target snapshot before restoring state, ignores intermediate restore states, and discards delayed commits when history has moved. Find similar needs the desktop backend, so I traced that restore path in code instead of running it in preview.\\n\\nPreview Back×4 and Forward×4 round-tripped through a view change, a Space, a Spider-Man search, and the opened item. Biome and TypeScript checks passed. I didn’t add a Bun test because this behavior depends on React effects and overlay state.\\n\\nCommitted and pushed as `bc69b0479f280ec843f1d95b862bc5d3de543195`. The worktree is clean.\",\"resultContextTransferId\":\"context-transfer:type:subagent_result:source-thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:target-thread:d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f:f48d9f11-c3dd-4fc7-a06c-b04b5ec2a932\",\"hasPendingQuestion\":false,\"waitTimedOut\":false}"}]},"uuid":"7abed886-bc66-4a1c-84ef-38eb9502684d","timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:34:01.645Z","toolUseResult":"{\"taskId\":\"node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Ahistory-fix-r4-forward\",\"childThreadId\":\"thread:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Ahistory-fix-r4-forward\",\"childRunId\":\"run:thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:ordinal:1\",\"childNodeId\":\"node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Ahistory-fix-r4-forward\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"workState\":\"result_available\",\"hasPendingChildRuns\":false,\"latestTerminalRunId\":\"run:thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:ordinal:1\",\"latestTerminalStatus\":\"completed\",\"latestTerminalSummary\":\"Cause: when Back closed the open item, the history effect saw the intermediate similar-mode state as new navigation and replaced the forward entries. A delayed search commit could also write a stale snapshot after navigation.\\n\\nThe fix marks the target snapshot before restoring state, ignores intermediate restore states, and discards delayed commits when history has moved. Find similar needs the desktop backend, so I traced that restore path in code instead of running it in preview.\\n\\nPreview Back×4 and Forward×4 round-tripped through a view change, a Space, a Spider-Man search, and the opened item. Biome and TypeScript checks passed. I didn’t add a Bun test because this behavior depends on React effects and overlay state.\\n\\nCommitted and pushed as `bc69b0479f280ec843f1d95b862bc5d3de543195`. The worktree is clean.\",\"latestTerminalResultContextTransferId\":\"context-transfer:type:subagent_result:source-thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:target-thread:d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f:f48d9f11-c3dd-4fc7-a06c-b04b5ec2a932\",\"providerInstanceId\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"summary\":\"Cause: when Back closed the open item, the history effect saw the intermediate similar-mode state as new navigation and replaced the forward entries. A delayed search commit could also write a stale snapshot after navigation.\\n\\nThe fix marks the target snapshot before restoring state, ignores intermediate restore states, and discards delayed commits when history has moved. Find similar needs the desktop backend, so I traced that restore path in code instead of running it in preview.\\n\\nPreview Back×4 and Forward×4 round-tripped through a view change, a Space, a Spider-Man search, and the opened item. Biome and TypeScript checks passed. I didn’t add a Bun test because this behavior depends on React effects and overlay state.\\n\\nCommitted and pushed as `bc69b0479f280ec843f1d95b862bc5d3de543195`. The worktree is clean.\",\"resultContextTransferId\":\"context-transfer:type:subagent_result:source-thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:target-thread:d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f:f48d9f11-c3dd-4fc7-a06c-b04b5ec2a932\",\"hasPendingQuestion\":false,\"waitTimedOut\":false}","mcpMeta":{"structuredContent":{"taskId":"node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Ahistory-fix-r4-forward","childThreadId":"thread:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Ahistory-fix-r4-forward","childRunId":"run:thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:ordinal:1","childNodeId":"node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%3Adelegate-task%3Ahistory-fix-r4-forward","status":"completed","workState":"result_available","hasPendingChildRuns":false,"latestTerminalRunId":"run:thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:ordinal:1","latestTerminalStatus":"completed","latestTerminalSummary":"Cause: when Back closed the open item, the history effect saw the intermediate similar-mode state as new navigation and replaced the forward entries. A delayed search commit could also write a stale snapshot after navigation.\n\nThe fix marks the target snapshot before restoring state, ignores intermediate restore states, and discards delayed commits when history has moved. Find similar needs the desktop backend, so I traced that restore path in code instead of running it in preview.\n\nPreview Back×4 and Forward×4 round-tripped through a view change, a Space, a Spider-Man search, and the opened item. Biome and TypeScript checks passed. I didn’t add a Bun test because this behavior depends on React effects and overlay state.\n\nCommitted and pushed as `bc69b0479f280ec843f1d95b862bc5d3de543195`. The worktree is clean.","latestTerminalResultContextTransferId":"context-transfer:type:subagent_result:source-thread:thread%3Adelegated-task%3Acommand%253Amcp%253A210d5aa8-30e5-4bb6-825d-804a23723a98%253Adelegate-task%253Ahistory-fix-r4-forward:target-thread:d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f:f48d9f11-c3dd-4fc7-a06c-b04b5ec2a932","providerInstanceId":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","summary":"Cause: when Back closed the open item, the history effect saw the intermediate similar-mode state as new navigation and replaced the forward entries. A delayed search commit could also write a stale snapshot after navigation.\n\nThe fix marks the target snapshot before restoring state, ignores intermediate restore states, and discards delayed commits when history has moved. Find similar needs the desktop backend, so I traced that restore path in code instead of running it in preview.\n\nPreview Back×4 and Forward×4 round-tripped through a view change, a Space, a Spider-Man search, and the opened item. Biome and TypeScript checks passed. I didn’t add a Bun test because this behavior depends on React effects and overlay state.\n\nCommitted and pushed as `bc69b0479f280ec843f1d95b862bc5d3de543195`. The worktree is clean.","resultContextTransferId":"context-transfer:type:subagent_result:source-threa